itest (#34996)\n\n* chore(server): migrate environment_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore(server): keep files_spec.ts on mocha (makeDataContext GraphQL realm)\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore(server): migrate TelemetryManager_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\nCo-authored-by: Ryan Manuel <ryanm@cypress.io>","tree":{"sha":"cb46a97e489da4d7748dbf65627a920344211c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/cb46a97e489da4d7748dbf65627a920344211c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/b1f8aa767352bf60bedcc80d492224a1f6c4b972","verification":{"payload":"tree cb46a97e489da4d7748dbf65627a920344211c3b\nparent dce5487e1ce5abf894aa69f768be9a78ffbc1f44\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791386856 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791386856 -0500\n\nchore: migrate 2 @packages/server unit specs to vitest (#34996)\n\n* chore(server): migrate environment_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore(server): keep files_spec.ts on mocha (makeDataContext GraphQL realm)\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore(server): migrate TelemetryManager_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\nCo-authored-by: Ryan Manuel <ryanm@cypress.io>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxmToCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6I4QAH/5NVkjI05mBLUxSaEFCMgp\nDW7X1th3VlZxU6xSbI7FGQIwBMv1rcWWF1J6N6zEQbvapTG5jxElhQs0Q8Q7L+VD\nXs/8O0fBdGGuQgu4BCjylATU6CdNZ9nH3W/P6RBkc5Rv49cjaHKRsp1Yeq/oOGCz\nEzixqxrMBnr48tmEiJagWMyqspYYKB/JYW6LTkYjPlFUeJ9y1lXvrKgUKhWecgdJ\nm9H6JfTQLwcURAGwxbFe1OQJRbwzNR5kzuGei23FaOir0S1w/0H3zMNAg9szXSJA\n3D+x2Fi2PAf6sfL