//api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/e3fbadbf572ff6b3bcf192c1b20565bdda56e72b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:45:42Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:45:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: fail cy.get() on an intercept alias index of 0 without waiting out the timeout (#34936)\n\n* fix: fail cy.get() on an intercept alias index of 0 without waiting out the timeout\n\nAsking for index 0 of an intercept alias can never succeed, so mark the\nalias_zero error as not retryable. The existing test now asserts that the\nfailure arrives well before the command timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n* chore: link changelog entry to #34936\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n* chore: move changelog entry for #34936 to 16.2.0\n\n16.1.1 has shipped, so the entry belongs in the next release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d649ae9a84d20ea1ba452344621fcaf713556d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/d649ae9a84d20ea1ba452344621fcaf713556d7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/e3fbadbf572ff6b3bcf192c1b20565bdda56e72b","verification":{"payload":"tree d649ae9a84d20ea1ba452344621fcaf713556d7a\nparent 3a329f571637dc76f662851558cd6a28bd0be891\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1791319542 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791319542 -0400\n\nfix: fail cy.get() on an intercept alias index of 0 without waiting out the timeout (#34936)\n\n* fix: fail cy.get() on an intercept alias index of 0 without waiting out the timeout\n\nAsking for index 0 of an intercept alias can never succeed, so mark the\nalias_zero error as not retryable. The existing test now asserts that the\nfailure arrives well before the command timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n* chore: link changelog entry to #34936\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n* chore: move changelog entry for #34936 to 16.2.0\n\n16.1.1 has shipped, so the entry belongs in the next release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011BTFWhDt7LCZEAZXMwS6S6\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxV32CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHxkQAB4UNvGApAiTFOMJ9VCNgVQv\nc5B7M6dIRgS7KVy9I2NEZCfwc38OtUiewLrxxcOZzF9qiqxeNaIDM5FZQ5J9MoBo\n0ddHZGR1nqNJKPSPWatw+UesJF1QesyB5uBCgMKkwa02KaBrurIvX/NmXCJfDohq\nZNISux9Pd+Df6XfioX3JTMs92COEH/9AB5K8f2AwobAOqO5GI8SsIA3VaNWkNnqC\nV3zPSzM/TryHDoZIbfkSaEXwr8wcmxdaTp9UdJBGiMug7L3o30R61b4dRyK65+53\nZFFNNxKUzrdC4tpV7qI4p2bkunqJpGZl6f1Y/C2qAobLYPSXsz4n4BU19nwOo0HV\nG4zubv0iXzesoMM3GGKSMfPOzsUkCs/MzHnHpxR30iwlAXPsZgW4gxW3shybEo2o\nxwCzAJtjrdNAwxo6HB8Qd6PH9MGdUG2Nghe4AdcvAZgwZAbH28sEYP4S0tghMjp6\nTa3igbMdG7NmU4HmwBR0uun6X/qUCOK/INEuLyQagE3JBDF/ho0+bLsMcEWAxYly\nFl9EwXuO0n0J8zucUj5Kv/u6IFZaUoRk0iS3anBi836GLqm22Dy1cf20S4YmcLKm