nuel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryanthemanuel","id":4873279,"login":"ryanthemanuel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzMyNzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanthemanuel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/7d987f04740f8f5388ac3116e8ef7957373ead14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:04:54Z","email":"ryanm@cypress.io","name":"Ryan Manuel"},"comment_count":4,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:04:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: park the real pointer before mounting InlineRunAllSpecs (#34972)\n\nrealHover() moves the browser''s real pointer, which persists across tests\nand retries. The tooltip has no show delay, so when the pointer is left\nover the trigger, the tooltip opens on mount and the initial\n`should(''not.exist'')` assertion fails on every retry. Move the pointer to\nthe top-left of the body before mounting, matching the existing\nworkaround in GroupedDebugFailedTest.cy.tsx.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a33f27effa82e8cae5bed58934df35a02a330f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/a33f27effa82e8cae5bed58934df35a02a330f38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/7d987f04740f8f5388ac3116e8ef7957373ead14","verification":{"payload":"tree a33f27effa82e8cae5bed58934df35a02a330f38\nparent 002101299443a8e1e924e407e41bfddd2def0a36\nauthor Ryan Manuel <ryanm@cypress.io> 1790953494 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790953494 -0500\n\ntest: park the real pointer before mounting InlineRunAllSpecs (#34972)\n\nrealHover() moves the browser''s real pointer, which persists across tests\nand retries. The tooltip has no show delay, so when the pointer is left\nover the trigger, the tooltip opens on mount and the initial\n`should(''not.exist'')` assertion fails on every retry. Move the pointer to\nthe top-left of the body before mounting, matching the existing\nworkaround in GroupedDebugFailedTest.cy.tsx.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv8gWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb2QQAHIaBC2boZfYlALbgpMSRl+/\nNNLER+j4yqjPdN8ukkuQaqL4hulVlu3RvsXOv98MZbXfQfnyTHtAhiiUnvNsnuor\nQZEXX6u3Y0RxT2A1Bt+i4M+y0s3imOslvzHvjXdzfxNLxthhnnkprrntCc3t4MFA\nnSUlT8/8JiXj0yAKz4SDwysu9PjC/ANSTFfjrj/PVEjDPF5tyjD0GGvf4YV8qNgw\nWhguYesebRbGsryyQwWYtbr1NBEx9ZGg6y/XDkhpACbcAshGjApsb96jgESdZYf2\nYh2ySoGgmNZmOT/tA4aAhhLA3GBxHvJP7D9wFDtoGjOOyFBEfQpvJbsgnq8cehO0\nebXhDCcMuVfm6SWE4RLzUlk2hRSEPvamLyXMBwd1P12SVHyNXfp6i0l7kfBs4hxD\nwzLKI+vHWRsa6VLZZq74rZuJoLr7hnAHlGPgoz6mYuyrL4elyUZuu9on0Wnf/gs9\n3CzAEIpXRIl8trc3/g46g5Qhujbpi/7bEhZmrkmv137ZstRNs4i7WpH1wcI7BCX4\n66zlbVKpyj4XOg0eEwjAxdbJRh7rNR12B7oy3Ek60R2rHSBsJH0jHzeS4D3bnsf4\nREDwRzVlxkbP1R2t2ls73Co6svzDGaWUoS1bbG/Z/JbqBSgkFkmSkZP81aKZIgWR\n+2pDMlsHHTekqUcH48i1\n=R+2m\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T15:04:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"