nifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/74642723ab295de0839b1e70e60b0ec87c7ef808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:01:45Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:01:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: refresh browsers in the Docker image step of the release process (#34957)\n\nStep 12 only mentioned CYPRESS_VERSION, so the 16.1.1 Docker image bump\nskipped the browser refresh that earlier releases included and left the\nimages a major version behind. List every factory/.env pin to update.\n\nRefs cypress-io/cypress-docker-images#1610\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H3L2MmSbRKaYFQF6Yhw5JN\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a2760acf91bc8a87f62421f244c9e28ae58a7cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/0a2760acf91bc8a87f62421f244c9e28ae58a7cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/74642723ab295de0839b1e70e60b0ec87c7ef808","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a2760acf91bc8a87f62421f244c9e28ae58a7cf\nparent f230f7e02ba07eefc57a3f05ab92bd83c61f124b\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790784105 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790784105 -0400\n\ndocs: refresh browsers in the Docker image step of the release process (#34957)\n\nStep 12 only mentioned CYPRESS_VERSION, so the 16.1.1 Docker image bump\nskipped the browser refresh that earlier releases included and left the\nimages a major version behind. List every factory/.env pin to update.\n\nRefs cypress-io/cypress-docker-images#1610\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01H3L2MmSbRKaYFQF6Yhw5JN\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTJpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARjAQAF5Ffr99MpuZqFw8gR/1yPjH\nxMXxSKdbhOPO1ddN