e `toString` and `assign` that throw\nat runtime. Add Cypress.AUTLocation and point both overloads at it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMWCmsUUMwhAEzzXHf3nrG\n\n* misc: trim cy.location() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMWCmsUUMwhAEzzXHf3nrG\n\n* misc: link cy.location() changelog entry to #34956\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMWCmsUUMwhAEzzXHf3nrG\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd0c3e92ded0555d849de23ded4330f52c7e0f9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/fd0c3e92ded0555d849de23ded4330f52c7e0f9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/f230f7e02ba07eefc57a3f05ab92bd83c61f124b","verification":{"payload":"tree fd0c3e92ded0555d849de23ded4330f52c7e0f9c\nparent 88472712e81d6183a37c23478dd6526a6692062e\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790784061 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790784061 -0400\n\nmisc: type cy.location() as the object it actually yields (#34956)\n\n* misc: type cy.location() as the object it actually yields\n\ncy.location() yields a plain object built from the AUT''s URL, not\nwindow.location, but its types used the DOM Location. That rejected\n`searchParams` and accepted keys like `toString` and `assign` that throw\nat runtime. Add Cypress.AUTLocation and point both overloads at it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMWCmsUUMwhAEzzXHf3nrG\n\n* misc: trim cy.location() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UMWCmsUUMwhAEzzXHf3nrG\n\n* misc: link cy.location() changelog entry to #34956\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 