er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/727c47ba3b3b44f025a7b5c2b050bee4e7313e26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:25:50Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":7,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T20:25:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"misc: show cy.contains() as a parent command in the Command Log when it starts a chain (#34939)\n\n* fix: log cy.contains() as a parent command when it starts a chain\n\ncy.contains() read hasPreviouslyLinkedCommand without calling it, so the\nfunction reference was always truthy and every contains log was typed\n''child''. Call the method so a chain-starting cy.contains() logs as\n''parent''.\n\nAdd a driver test for the parent case and update the protocol system-test\nsnapshot, whose cy.contains(''hi'') entries were recording the old type.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n* misc: move cy.contains() Command Log entry to the Misc changelog section\n\nThe change only affects how cy.contains() is displayed in the Command\nLog, so it belongs under Misc with an \"Addressed in\" lead-in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n* misc: link the cy.contains() changelog entry to #34939\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35413d2c193c659cb1a9303790bd55318dcde4c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/35413d2c193c659cb1a9303790bd55318dcde4c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/727c47ba3b3b44f025a7b5c2b050bee4e7313e26","verification":{"payload":"tree 35413d2c193c659cb1a9303790bd55318dcde4c5\nparent 6395a6db90ec7937d0d5a957d627946c73f717db\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790627150 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790627150 -0400\n\nmisc: show cy.contains() as a parent command in the Command Log when it starts a chain (#34939)\n\n* fix: log cy.contains() as a parent command when it starts a chain\n\ncy.contains() read hasPreviouslyLinkedCommand without calling it, so the\nfunction reference was always truthy and every contains log was typed\n''child''. Call the method so a chain-starting cy.contains() logs as\n''parent''.\n\nAdd a driver test for the parent case and update the protocol system-test\nsnapshot, whose cy.contains(''hi'') entries were recording the old type.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n* misc: move cy.contains() Command Log entry to the Misc changelog section\n\nThe change only affects how cy.contains() is displayed in the Command\nLog, so it belongs under Misc with an \"Addressed in\" lead-in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n* misc: link the cy.contains() changelog entry to #34939\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127JYg5iiRHgk6g33uES1kt\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqus1PCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9voQABD6lKkgMk1ucCz/B21FsXJy\npmN2MP2Y0k1hk7XEfGlmLGI1Bi3otMOBskEwtYLXkckizuItQNhuNglgHL1UYm02\nDQMm7Zc/pvUNOqiYep0HEfXrQftbMMpo/PJ0LOEQKAiTuSP3WYzaJT0E7Mb/AAof\nfN5oTiJHoKHs6sHB5pQVmas9EOrTl7Tx+0MiX44moUP3ZlCDpIXdpJwHFDc/oLdI\nG4ZfPdd5XtcT46dby/byZUJsAAVUC+h/0Ep1jHKoiGAI5v4NvaC94BkMiycm1H3A\nkMrBN03x2h4uFDf+yyR2U3d8BFZKv1ynamyL8LoNJGgiGh27E1CgV0Y56WOobhuU\nWQWW0FIQq7WQFhCLwE6TC