ns_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/commit/21122f50f1377b3e7a7dce8de59018da82aaa807","node_id":"C_kwDOAeKht9oAKDIxMTIyZjUwZjEzNzdiM2U3YTdkY2U4ZGU1OTAxOGRhODJhYWE4MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/commit/3e1949fb42616db9be5c33f9da794b444205c73b","sha":"3e1949fb42616db9be5c33f9da794b444205c73b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/3e1949fb42616db9be5c33f9da794b444205c73b"}],"sha":"21122f50f1377b3e7a7dce8de59018da82aaa807","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/21122f50f1377b3e7a7dce8de59018da82aaa807"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1271364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jennifer-shehane","id":1271364,"login":"jennifer-shehane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzEzNjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/3e1949fb42616db9be5c33f9da794b444205c73b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T23:21:05Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T23:21:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"misc: document the true default of multiple for .dblclick() in types (#34929)\n\n* misc: document the true default of multiple for .dblclick() in types\n\n.dblclick() double clicks every element in the subject unless passed\n{ multiple: false }, but its overloads shared ClickOptions, whose JSDoc\ndocuments multiple as defaulting to false. Add DblClickOptions, which\nredeclares multiple with @default true, and point the three .dblclick()\noverloads at it. .click() and .rightclick() keep ClickOptions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n* misc: shorten the .dblclick() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n* misc: link the .dblclick() changelog entry to its PR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54bc8f18bafaca872dcf14bb7225b46ea1c35aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/54bc8f18bafaca872dcf14bb7225b46ea1c35aab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/3e1949fb42616db9be5c33f9da794b444205c73b","verification":{"payload":"tree 54bc8f18bafaca872dcf14bb7225b46ea1c35aab\nparent c8aed0b2923e038acf1565134d88eec52ae085ea\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790464865 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790464865 -0400\n\nmisc: document the true default of multiple for .dblclick() in types (#34929)\n\n* misc: document the true default of multiple for .dblclick() in types\n\n.dblclick() double clicks every element in the subject unless passed\n{ multiple: false }, but its overloads shared ClickOptions, whose JSDoc\ndocuments multiple as defaulting to false. Add DblClickOptions, which\nredeclares multiple with @default true, and point the three .dblclick()\noverloads at it. .click() and .rightclick() keep ClickOptions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n* misc: shorten the .dblclick() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n* misc: link the .dblclick() changelog entry to its PR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C4Zvc8SqXPkTrNukHPtYoL\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquFNhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApI0QABaE4wxQqL777Wojzli3CmYz\nro4DbpdHASuJW8QZgSh6ACs4xV72+wE8YkOC2w6KH2H1R3YKicF9FKAQZEPmzxkt\nT1Zu6ZOGGM5w8q3tpxsi0UV/gqfizXAi/wUaJpJ/LjPe5bEduNRWLCUJk3468HSh\nx8TzLphKr+/h/Iir2/YzCG4CAnH+g/TgjbmbSu33Fxguc4+pY4anMWgZ5l3n8OkD\nVhWYNyK+roGD9IyDLsjsTWeDKCQxHRPpbXydlEkgKkH2u9w0zbrwKA1jrKWCBAIS\nvPlt6mXbkQjQunvhQeuk/ZqwT3vXGRbPelxMRk7Tc9aWMIWeSZC7rEYXY+COeNCY\nnSoczQSWD7OSHhRiBR4cmZXS+PU90vOCBvhmQj3gpRiDMz+mSN/pc6hG1pp1470G\nB4OCV6dkrYJlXQCUb2zqGeP5+KZs6qQwnGOPLDRgPjb6JncuLcvcmMc9b+hnx3FE\nIK+lyDXmTBYOyDJf9WV2PFuLgl4nSyTYkuL70lSl3MGBKmS2wmbOIh22wLaae/mu\nYUAxKOFuY8Qz1MKPPTJwG0GKcttxL49J42GrzSj4haQ5ES+4F3UwPX5JD7TER6oR\nl1wgInRSl5/+KwgAH3ENJr7NB8arPtqVPcnljYNO1p4QezDGGNg1rWvBva0cz3js\nHDUXQG5a7fzoz/aZrZ46\n=hnbq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T23:21:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_us