sers/jennifer-shehane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jennifer-shehane","id":1271364,"login":"jennifer-shehane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzEzNjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/aecb1cb6419a2a8a5e220639daa447cdb3143cb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:35:22Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T21:35:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(puppeteer): always disconnect, report falsy rejections, and fix retry timeout (#34907)\n\n- Always call browser.disconnect() after a message handler runs, even when\n  refocusing the main tab fails, and report the handler''s own error ahead\n  of the tab activation error\n- Treat handler rejections with falsy values (undefined, null, 0, '''') as\n  errors instead of successes, and stop crashing on null\n- Measure retry()''s timeout by wall-clock time so it includes time spent in\n  the retried function, stops looping forever when delayBetweenTries is 0,\n  and doesn''t wait an extra delay before failing\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014a1NdiF2KUVWZksk6h1GGP\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e893dcacb8f323999f4fcf9cfc30835a6cb96f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/e893dcacb8f323999f4fcf9cfc30835a6cb96f69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/aecb1cb6419a2a8a5e220639daa447cdb3143cb8","verification":{"payload":"tree e893dcacb8f323999f4fcf9cfc30835a6cb96f69\nparent 1f32e142e60f2239ae67e7a928e9576c9a4114c6\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790285722 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790285722 -0400\n\nfix(puppeteer): always disconnect, report falsy rejections, and fix retry timeout (#34907)\n\n- Always call browser.disconnect() after a message handler runs, even when\n  refocusing the main tab fails, and report the handler''s own error ahead\n  of the tab activation error\n- Treat handler rejections with falsy values (undefined, null, 0, '''') as\n  errors instead of successes, and stop crashing on null\n- Measure retry()''s timeout by wall-clock time so it includes time spent in\n  the retried function, stops looping forever when delayBetweenTries is 0,\n  and doesn''t wait an extra delay before failing\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014a1NdiF2KUVWZksk6h1GGP\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtZeaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqqwQABx4S4iTKSxAp/6c5kZljtUS\nuLgGTYqFWukKFsmbi6MaLyYbE2unWKPqbngysFTYcTABODjh1E48Pv3tDrZPVQHe\nMal3paC0d74nQGQIZHyL9hKOECk5jednKAOYotPwoozHiDRsfPLG+KM/3vZXJmBk\nkj7zRQIjwt6wK/ZqmN0pWpG9MyEsRvz75ia1h3i2OWLYKYDAU/0SzKC/+ci5tkrc\nDutN7QFYqWSueu2fMDrRKPwNW20pZa1UEoEZLab/H/SNFooTOsiivA77JM+nCq13\ncVzOlsx946WK4cTkDa9Y4h+Bw1QfDXUr3nPfXfegmwpM121DYCofY6r3fzHuqi7h\n/HuMVLPpGHosI83rB6UsE2bKsk2t4OdU4gloCuqwfbXx3tf54df5YLEjchCr+JtL\nP0YqfCLAh+kMalx/64auLLMJp9JQ6qORBid0zubmy9JY1t2O+W/AYUujJAozmWkn\nNABhmTAAtbP3c+pz5bRcy1qyuewa+mqC7L9TnEynUIaLQ7/wX/bnEeWYO6BEf3q4\nJdR+O82iMqWowM9J6g/kS+J5nL68PYvrXN5SdeYbLoFzWKd/Wro9G1MQgg7E/yzT\nA3