ss.io>\n\n* chore: migrate human_time_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: move static imports to the top of the converted specs\n\nvitest hoists `vi.mock` above the file''s imports, so importing the\nmodule under test below the mock factory changed nothing at runtime and\nimplied an ordering requirement that does not exist.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\nCo-authored-by: Bill Glesias <bglesias@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Matt Schile <mschile@cypress.io>","tree":{"sha":"bd2d980ced77033696f565279e242fccf694c824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/bd2d980ced77033696f565279e242fccf694c824"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/1f32e142e60f2239ae67e7a928e9576c9a4114c6","verification":{"payload":"tree bd2d980ced77033696f565279e242fccf694c824\nparent 1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1790282768 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790282768 -0600\n\nchore: migrate 10 @packages/server unit specs to vitest (#34881)\n\n* chore: migrate configurator-network-policy_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate cache_buster_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate require_script_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate links_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate obj_utils_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate random_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate duration_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate electron-app_spec.ts to vitest\n\nCo-authored-by: bill <bill@cypress.io>\n\n* chore: migrate newlines