low","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/commit/1f32e142e60f2239ae67e7a928e9576c9a4114c6","node_id":"C_kwDOAeKht9oAKDFmMzJlMTQyZTYwZjIyMzlhZTY3ZTdhOTI4ZTk1NzZjOWE0MTE0YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/commit/1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54","sha":"1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54"}],"sha":"1f32e142e60f2239ae67e7a928e9576c9a4114c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/1f32e142e60f2239ae67e7a928e9576c9a4114c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1271364?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jennifer-shehane","id":1271364,"login":"jennifer-shehane","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzEzNjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jennifer-shehane","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/commits/1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:46:05Z","email":"jennifer@cypress.io","name":"Jennifer Shehane"},"comment_count":3,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:46:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"misc: describe the elements cy.clear() accepts in its invalid element error (#34914)\n\n* misc: describe the elements cy.clear() accepts in its invalid element error\n\nThe clear.invalid_element error listed the selectors for focusable\nelements, so a button, select, a[href], checkbox, or radio failed with a\nmessage that implied it should work. The message now lists what\nisTextLike() accepts: a textarea, a text-like input, or a contenteditable\nor designMode element. The input types come from a shared\ntextLikeInputTypes list so the message and the check can''t drift.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n* misc: trim the cy.clear() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n* misc: link the cy.clear() changelog entry to its PR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59bea09b5e245546bb3665115ba1ccbcf567f8e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/trees/59bea09b5e245546bb3665115ba1ccbcf567f8e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/git/commits/1fdfd114b0452e7a03cd771320ae12e9d167ce54","verification":{"payload":"tree 59bea09b5e245546bb3665115ba1ccbcf567f8e4\nparent acdc34668084434e4178ccfac3e347f3b6ca09fc\nauthor Jennifer Shehane <jennifer@cypress.io> 1790275565 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790275565 -0400\n\nmisc: describe the elements cy.clear() accepts in its invalid element error (#34914)\n\n* misc: describe the elements cy.clear() accepts in its invalid element error\n\nThe clear.invalid_element error listed the selectors for focusable\nelements, so a button, select, a[href], checkbox, or radio failed with a\nmessage that implied it should work. The message now lists what\nisTextLike() accepts: a textarea, a text-like input, or a contenteditable\nor designMode element. The input types come from a shared\ntextLikeInputTypes list so the message and the check can''t drift.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n* misc: trim the cy.clear() changelog entry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n* misc: link the cy.clear() changelog entry to its PR\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VZ8dS4r81BEHMujqMGFcK2\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtW/tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8nQQADWzBirKryKpK6wex5HzLtSO\n9N1ki6eMEpITNRHeV8vEKnveaVrPthaH9gP+TLXTRwLXXSm7654WT80q89JNRslj\npTMAzRZiBcQMK2AyZuZvTXY2TAZV7yxMBrHcIN/FABP94whvLWGpATT+dXj5iMK0\n+P7K/2gQr48P/N9jOl1cIY3wx61/y94cm+6AX7558Zdoeo8ytfO/lj5BXBLSppJf\nmbGYv5nkZwUwQwjF4o0IrkMxbgRO2XJPzTwRNtRPF3dqCUJrcxn3qFijvEM2uALd\n/52+Gv9J77Vv9WjiVCmMUR433wlZTO98fGJY+IZGXxLYwsJHQgR/MTJsDJhjss4K\n18qb69EfytNK5pP8Zss8Rc0wqo3tMfxChL95l6j8OvGB54bl4/UjlQT+IXbz0Wj4\n4s50U2WvFPjtXPGYI9MJ2TZtq//WXxWpkb0RF82zojdMxcVYhNH8eeLW8TqlN+vS\nAMJ+39tL3ydkPz0TAXDCzaAJ7LRuEqg9f3HIvBqlaX7qNzuHu9858tbq0nKibNjl\nfwDI9+zF3KfEfLxXCE1fx6N5