"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/commits/5e86a8de378eb16a0a74a04dc5c2473e02118083/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:47:15Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:47:15Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"[Studio] Register CoreShop field types in the class definition editor\n\nStudio keeps two frontend registries per DataObject field type: the\nObjectDataRegistry renders the value in the object editor, the\nFieldDefinitionRegistry drives the class definition editor and its\n\"add field\" dropdown. CoreShop only registered its 31 CoreExtension\ntypes in the first one, so the class editor showed \"Type not supported\"\nand the types could not be added through Studio at all.\n\nEvery type now has a DynamicTypeFieldDefinitionCoreShop* counterpart\nnext to its object data type, grouped under a new \"CoreShop\" entry in\nthe dropdown. The abstract base, the group registration and the shared\nwidth/height/min-max form items live in PimcoreBundle because\nMoneyBundle, PimcoreBundle and ProductQuantityPriceRulesBundle do not\ndepend on ResourceBundle; ResourceBundle adds the select, multiselect\nand relation bases on top. Form field names match the public\nproperties of the PHP CoreExtension classes, since the class editor\nsaves the raw field definition.\n\nTranslations (en/de) follow Pimcore''s field-definition.<kebab-case id>\nscheme including the with-prefix variants. Documentation in\ndocs/03_Development/14_Studio/02_Base_Infrastructure/06_Dynamic_Types.md.\n\nCloses #3260","tree":{"sha":"aa988adb091424f188567242eee9817bc8e959b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/git/trees/aa988adb091424f188567242eee9817bc8e959b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/git/commits/5e86a8de378eb16a0a74a04dc5c2473e02118083","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coreshop/CoreShop/commit/5e86a8de378eb16a0a74a04dc5c2473e02118083","node_id":"C_kwDOAe4WUNoAKDVlODZhOGRlMzc4ZWIxNmEwYTc0YTA0ZGM1YzI0NzNlMDIxMTgwODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coreshop/CoreShop/commit/8201c8179233a51cc72c4640e6b7b33bacd407aa","sha":"8201c8179233a51cc72c4640e6b7b33bacd407aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/commits/8201c8179233a51cc72c4640e6b7b33bacd407aa"}