 matrices, the concurrency\ngroups and the tmpfs test database over from 5.1.\n\nThe workflow files differ between the two lines — 2026.x runs PHP 8.4/8.5\nagainst Pimcore ^2026.2 and resolves fork pull requests through\n`pull_request_target` — so the conflicting matrices keep their 2026.x values\nand only the sharding is taken from 5.1.\n\nAlso restores .github/workflows/frontend-build.yaml, which the earlier\nconflict resolution on this branch had deleted. It exists on both lines and\ndiffers only in the branch it triggers on, so it keeps the 2026.x value like\nevery other branch-dependent setting in an upmerge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VWMX8v7VHha67Tk1LUeH3D","tree":{"sha":"dea57856de97550c9ebcbcd0c8eca343a8dcd1cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/git/trees/dea57856de97550c9ebcbcd0c8eca343a8dcd1cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreshop/CoreShop/git/commits/27505684556c12cb49dbe1939588bd950e31a06a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git