ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/be2cb2b16b0f57aab59081246bec7d85ee11cf4c","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKGJlMmNiMmIxNmIwZjU3YWFiNTkwODEyNDZiZWM3ZDg1ZWUxMWNmNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108","sha":"d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108"}],"sha":"be2cb2b16b0f57aab59081246bec7d85ee11cf4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/be2cb2b16b0f57aab59081246bec7d85ee11cf4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/10562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/mergify","id":37929162,"login":"mergify[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90Mzc5MjkxNjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:50:19Z","email":"37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mergify[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:50:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(api): duplicate a Native API whose definition carries configurations (#20937)\n\nDuplicating any real Kafka Service answered 400 \"Configuration must be a JSON\nobject\". The Native duplicate exports the source and hands the export to the\nimport pipeline, but ImportExportApiMapper#map shapes that export for its JSON\noutput: it turns every entrypoint and endpoint configuration into a JsonNode.\nThe import mappers accept a configuration only as a map or a JSON string, so\nthe first configuration they met was refused. The existing test duplicated a\ndefinition with no entrypoints and no endpoints, which hid it.\n\nThe export now goes through its JSON text before the import, exactly as an\nexport followed by an import does and as a promotion does with its stored\ndefinition. The test now carries entrypoint, shared and endpoint configurations\nand checks they reach the import unchanged.\n\nESM-243\n\n(cherry picked from commit dcebff1c753d666a209e279a3409b2ac759ca64a)\n\nCo-authored-by: ThibaudAv <thibaud.avenier@graviteesource.com>","tree":{"sha":"abad0308049e4982938b4afa8588cb3049674b11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/abad0308049e4982938b4afa8588cb3049674b11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108","verification":{"payload":"tree abad0308049e4982938b4afa8588cb3049674b11\nparent 93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19\nauthor mergify[bot] <37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791453019 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791453019 +0200\n\nfix(api): duplicate a Native API whose definition carries configurations (#20937)\n\nDuplicating any real Kafka Service answered 400 \"Configuration must be a JSON\nobject\". The Native duplicate exports the source and hands the export to the\nimport pipeline, but ImportExportApiMapper#map shapes that export for its JSON\noutput: it turns every entrypoint and endpoint configuration into a JsonNode.\nThe import mappers accept a configuration only as a map or a JSON string, so\nthe first configuration they met was refused. The existing test duplicated a\ndefinition with no entrypoints and no endpoints, which hid it.\n\nThe export now goes through its JSON text before the import, exactly as an\nexport followed by an import does and as a promotion does with its stored\ndefinition. The test now carries entrypoint, shared and endpoint configurations\nand checks they reach the import unchanged.\n\nESM-243\n\n(cherry picked from commit dcebff1c753d666a209e279a3409b2ac759ca64a)\n\nCo-authored-by: ThibaudAv <thibaud.avenier@graviteesource.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx2dbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2gQQADPLWJnesbHYK8R2Dn7P+17r\nwTYzFzyncaUYt/5dqfOrTptQR55YJp6kvTVFzFdbx87hfnOcWaCnsJJM81+/rr7Q\nmQ+qt5EPOxwshFtUTuHLrBAueSGplDUjZxMNVkDeOU6aw0VQcKfKUtF5Wa6SXTYI\nQPYIB1spdk4vQRbdkfR6VaMCLMcZ3uPoJIs+tZjXd8wu1MAbcR2Iw+bdP7w0wRUh\nTqlJQTOtSlsvbL0W8xAaE/TYJsUzc89PdQx6DAffgK8CUyMf+tjka7OXnDqiO+MK\nh+PaRTYly2iXWLULY0CFHw7qbMFIVBkFw1B1iws3sDtjMIuF6y/89MZ/1raSeyGA\nHjPtIi3gL17uaVF8BWb1++qlXRFWgYcPDUnL0+aWSUDR2rj10p5u1lOX6+MUZd7k\nIqcHMZaqiJrBv/rujcJfoLhx6NlERJC8sV492r1YNujG9f9fQJSOHg6nAGzWk60L\nGMIw/ylZVyrlvYaTNn0mI16TL2docKwN4ka/lLS1xyYviyn+vG2iCnhLs0yFCg0t\nqO6SzGR33TTrgMnqJAlZFvxLMeGu595NXLgV9Xz/0SauVNEvhO6aGMlbp6ERmwan\nLSbugG54qDNFoYVPv0etpAUkQlH0sVh8RCXinhX/RTQU27WQO94BECk2QLZ3MkTw\neI1V+OHiP16Z1P15VSe7\n=0m5P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:50:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKGQyNTI3ZmJlMGUxMzkyZDg0ZTIxZmZkYWFjMmM0ZjY3NzdlOTYxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19","sha":"93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19"}],"sha":"d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/d2527fbe0e1392d84e21ffdaac2c4f6777e96108"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/10562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/mergify","id":37929162,"login":"mergify[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90Mzc5MjkxNjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:01:44Z","email":"37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mergify[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T09:01:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(portal): do not report a Swagger viewer for pages with no saved viewer (#20896) (#20927)\n\nPageConfiguration.viewer had `default: Swagger` in the Portal API spec, so\nthe generated model always returned Swagger when the page configuration\nheld no viewer. Both portals treat that value as an explicit choice and\nnever applied the environment default OpenAPI viewer (e.g. Redoc).\n\nhttps://gravitee.atlassian.net/browse/APIM-15385\n(cherry picked from commit eb83d1ac616a2d9e520bfc2c87a2ed3b6eff46e0)\n\nCo-authored-by: thomasballivet <104570933+thomasballivet@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2d7075142d42f16d4ff4a8e9b7d2924d6f1b518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/a2d7075142d42f16d4ff4a8e9b7d2924d6f1b518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/93265201e772f9b9f3f6bc3b10f04cb655d8de19","verification":{"payload":"tree a2d7075142d42f16d4ff4a8e9b7d2924d6f1b518\nparent c188d7a8a0ea52110e4068650daad63842383f23\nauthor mergify[bot] <37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791450104 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791450104 +0200\n\nfix(portal): do not report a Swagger viewer for pages with no saved viewer (#20896) (#20927)\n\nPageConfiguration.viewer had `default: Swagger` in the Portal API spec, so\nthe generated model always returned Swagger when the page configuration\nheld no viewer. Both portals treat that value as an explicit choice and\nnever applied the environment default OpenAPI viewer (e.g. Redoc).\n\nhttps://gravitee.atlassian.net/browse/APIM-15385\n(cherry picked from commit eb83d1ac616a2d9e520bfc2c87a2ed3b6eff46e0)\n\nCo-authored-by: thomasballivet <104570933+thomasballivet@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1v4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPBEQAJq2hCdySQijbEmxs2D89CH0\nxwJYzRnnH7GDdXZ4ogAD2OJM2OBFOjwcEaXlqzHcPkyNNFzKfZrsoi5gmghAhimx\nQiC+bKIwH3+IAsu+dRDRPt+BtPvKQKWtjOlszLVBxwJjIWKh5il95uob7GKLz+01\nQ+K3xGzBbNs3S+NL5XnuA2BneMi3/w5JUo8eDS480fqks34kaqQF9S2leh8YZN9F\nl59I2NWx44KzGSbWTaz/iPrYrAxwDb2APVGIG7kcGN2lG1ROWbTd+DxF7zUAS7lJ\nSxNEIsPtjVOffWUwQU2SZhL0fKvzacP5P3q+8JPSivJ1Mjlrw6Qo/ldBfFGD1cCQ\nyheOmQPcyHY6G1F+ov5XrnHSmGUyKyX2YmcOUFQYuo/vCWXFFMMZKMCj/3QhdKTu\nFoC6ipgT2YDmrTbb3TtpxVtB+lmMfW73ESGXZl32KBgTPaY8PCNQ4UyIlKXp+n1i\nk+eLqkR/Kovpk34MDvsrhgXlG3dYk+O//QdcN8dSw8rxDhCyiafS24OruZ5vF7Wa\nQbhUuJOg4KPvpWS9pcxGl/OVpxYgpXRTVUV5bvbwqnPLH6PFTIVLTcS2fXnHlxkV\nrMVzBgxisZ7kLH2Ul1ZKalypTO2ylylc4naFuqpgpkmLfLG+GOFWsURbsY2DkQQ3\n6cwdOvbm3chVfEzHsfGV\n=ieuV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:01:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.