10562?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/mergify","id":37929162,"login":"mergify[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90Mzc5MjkxNjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mergify%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/b3dde020a865f0198cf87dfc819324a8ba505c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:32:30Z","email":"37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"mergify[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:32:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ui): show bootstrap error with retry in console and portals (#20893) (#20929)\n\n* Revert \"Revert \"fix(ui): show bootstrap error with retry in console and portals (#20482)\"\" (#20710)\n\nThis reverts commit d888f6d42037d27a33d8f07cf165adf42abf911f.\n\n* fix(portal-next): navigate to /503 with a cloneable state when bootstrap fails\n\nThe router stores the navigation state with history.pushState, which\ncannot clone a raw HttpErrorResponse: a bootstrap request failing before\nCORS applies (e.g. rejected by the API firewall) carries a ProgressEvent\nas body, so the portal crashed with a DataCloneError on a blank page.\n\nCarry only the status and the API errors to /503, and render the Retry\nbutton as a stroked button so it stays visible without the backend theme.\n\n(cherry picked from commit f467ee69200a8ffb812a5361ba0782ee24e13f97)\n\nCo-authored-by: thomasballivet <104570933+thomasballivet@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a4c7dc6b4d2bf9f46566d4edbc883fd6c4246c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/2a4c7dc6b4d2bf9f46566d4edbc883fd6c4246c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/b3dde020a865f0198cf87dfc819324a8ba505c43","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a4c7dc6b4d2bf9f46566d4edbc883fd6c4246c5\nparent 234fee48eeb056fab10b780f8aa9a496debd5b1f\nauthor mergify[bot] <37929162+mergify[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791448350 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791448350 +0200\n\nfix(ui): show bootstrap error with retry in console and portals (#20893) (#20929)\n\n* Revert \"Revert \"fix(ui): show bootstrap error with retry in console and portals (#20482)\"\" (#20710)\n\nThis reverts commit d888f6d42037d27a33d8f07cf165adf42abf911f.\n\n* fix(portal-next): navigate to /503 with a cloneable state when bootstrap fails\n\nThe router stores the navigation state with history.pushState, which\ncannot clone a raw HttpErrorResponse: a bootstrap request failing before\nCORS applies (e.g. rejected by the API firewall) carries a ProgressEvent\nas body, so the portal crashed with a DataCloneError on a blank page.\n\nCarry only the status and the API errors to /503, and render the Retry\nbutton as a stroked button so it stays visible without the backend theme.\n\n(cherry picked from commit f467ee69200a8ffb812a5361ba0782ee24e13f97)\n\nCo-authored-by: thomasballivet <104570933+thomasballivet@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1UeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA37gQAA5mey1JmeEMugerwEACWU9k\n02TMVATISUY0hrYNwr00IE3xlG3RPzFfKddLuwF8WNpsxB8ZSSBppL8afKQJMR7P\n