y OpenAPI that predate the\nfail-closed contract:\n\n- the entrypoint scope rule was stated three times, on the Logs tag, the\n  Analytics tag and the logs operation; it is now stated once, on the\n  Filters tag, and the others refer to it;\n- `FilterOperator` listed `NOT_IN`, which no filter advertises, and missed\n  `CONTAINS`;\n- the Analytics tag did not say that a filter the queried metric does not\n  carry (a Kafka filter on an HTTP metric) is not applied to it. Reporting\n  such filters in the response is OBS-130.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"4dec740467a5f97089917e4f70713d6557e91dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/4dec740467a5f97089917e4f70713d6557e91dd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/280df0159bb47a2067141007f53a13c93e7771e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/280df0159bb47a2067141007f53a13c93e7771e6","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDI4MGRmMDE1OWJiNDdhMjA2NzE0MTAwN2Y1M2ExM2M5M2U3NzcxZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982","sha":"9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982"}],"sha":"280df0159bb47a2067141007f53a13c93e7771e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/280df0159bb47a2067141007f53a13c93e7771e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:33:37Z","email":"sam.hardi.me@gmail.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:09:17Z","email":"117673449+SamHardi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"message":"fix(observability): check dashboard filters against the catalog on save\n\nA dashboard filter was stored without meeting the catalog and failed\nlater, on every widget: an unknown name, a field only the logs carry, an\noperator the filter does not advertise or a malformed value all saved\nfine, then turned each widget query into a 400, or, left empty, made the\nreader''s value silently disappear once the page split filters by signal.\n\nCreate and update now refuse such a filter with a 400 naming it, through\n`ObservabilityFilterValidator#validateDashboardFilters`: the catalog is\nthe source of truth, so a dashboard is refused when every query it makes\nwould be. The rules follow how the library reads a dashboard (OBS-52):\n\n- filters are checked against the ANALYTICS signal;\n- a filter with no value is the open \"Any\" slot and is accepted whatever\n  its `editable` flag, as the library renders it;\n- a field is filtered once, without the GTE + LTE exception of a search,\n  under its own code (`repeated_on_dashboard`).\n\nThe library''s JSON tab accepts a name its own catalog does not know (it\nmay be partial); the server holds the whole catalog and refuses it.\nSaved dashboards keep loading; one holding a filter the catalog refuses\ncan be re-saved once that filter is fixed. Widget filters stay opaque\nand are still checked at query time. A test replays the dashboard\nfilters of the AIM templates, which \"Duplicate as custom dashboard\"\nposts unchanged. The OpenAPI states the save-time check.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"8707956cdc3caedaa819107b3a73eff286a0423c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/8707956cdc3caedaa819107b3a73eff286a0423c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDk1NzdhZGE5M2QyMjlmMjg3Mjg0MTE5NjNmNzQ1NDJkNzgwN2I5ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997","sha":"5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997"}],"sha":"9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/9577ada93d229f28728411963f74542d7807b982"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:11:19Z","email":"sam.hardi.me@gmail.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:09:17Z","email":"117673449+SamHardi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"message":"fix(observability): name the missing RECORD_TYPE on decision filters\n\nA decision filter (AUTHZ_DECISION, AUTHZ_SUBJECT_ID, ...) sent to the logs\nsearch without `RECORD_TYPE = AUTHZ_DECISION` reached the request\ntranslator, which answered \"not yet supported for log search\": true of\nthe request documents, misleading for a caller who only forgot the\nrecord type. The search now refuses it before any read, with a message\nsaying which condition to add (`requires_decision_record_type`). The two\nexisting refusals of the same search, a `RECORD_TYPE` with several values\nand a filter the decision search cannot apply, now carry a technical code\ntoo (`multiple_record_types`, `not_applicable_to_decisions`).\n\nThe set of decision-only filters is derived from the decision allowlist\nand pinned against the catalog, like the allowlist itself. Analytics is\nunchanged: there the metric, not the record type, selects the decision\ndocuments.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"2baefb1a5ee9668c2b3eb72e0e22f74efd36325d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/2baefb1a5ee9668c2b3eb72e0e22f74efd36325d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDViOGQ2YWE5MjU5ZWY2OGU4ZWU4YWY1NjU4MzkyODEzODY3MmE5OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861","sha":"7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861"}],"sha":"5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/5b8d6aa9259ef68e8ee8af56583928138672a997"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:38:53Z","email":"sam.hardi.me@gmail.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:09:17Z","email":"117673449+SamHardi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"message":"fix(observability): resolve API_TYPE = AUTHZ on analytics as on logs\n\nThe filter catalog advertises `AUTHZ` as an `API_TYPE` value and the logs\nsearch honours it, but the analytics engine''s own API-type table lacked\nthe key, so the same chip answered rows on logs and a 400 on analytics\n(the sibling of the NATIVE gap, OBS-49).\n\nThe translation between definition types and observability kinds is now\none `ApiTypeAdapter`, replacing the copies in the analytics, logs and\nfilter-values adapters. The filter-values copy lacked `AUTHZ` and dropped\nit silently, which left an empty set the platform reads as \"every API\ntype\", so value listing for an AUTHZ dashboard was not narrowed.\n\n`ApiTypeAdapterTest` pins the mapping both ways and asserts that every\nAPI kind a caller can pick resolves on the analytics engine, so the next\nkind added to one table and not the other fails a test, not a widget.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"1b7038044a2817bc4c8172a641177c6f59e875c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/1b7038044a2817bc4c8172a641177c6f59e875c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDdkYTM2ZjY5N2Y2NWI4NmE4YWNiNmVmODhjNTRhNDQxYjIzODI4NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b","sha":"73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b"}],"sha":"7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/7da36f697f65b86a8acb6ef88c54a441b2382861"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:34:55Z","email":"sam.hardi.me@gmail.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:09:17Z","email":"117673449+SamHardi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"message":"fix(observability): one value per EQ/GTE/LTE, one condition per filter\n\nThe two signals read a malformed filter list differently, and neither\nsaid so:\n\n- `EQ`, `GTE`, `LTE` or `CONTAINS` with several values was truncated to\n  the first value by analytics and read as `IN` by logs;\n- a filter repeated in one request was ANDed by analytics and ORed (or\n  last-wins, for numeric bounds) by logs;\n- a null array element became an empty string, and an object or a nested\n  array was stringified into a value no document holds;\n- a NUMBER value that was not a whole number, or out of range, reached\n  the engines, and a range whose lower bound was above its upper bound\n  was refused by logs without a code and answered empty by analytics.\n\nThe validator now refuses each of these with a 400 naming the filter, the\noperator and the values (`invalid_arity`, `repeated`, `invalid_number`,\n`value_out_of_range`, `inverted_range`), and `FilterValues` refuses any\nvalue that is not a scalar or an array of scalars (`invalid_value_shape`),\non search and dashboard save alike. The one legal repetition is a `GTE`\nplus an `LTE` on the same NUMBER filter, a closed range both signals read\nas AND. Operators are upper-cased with `Locale.ROOT`, so a lowercase\noperator is read the same under any server locale. The OpenAPI lists the\nrules of a filter condition with their technical codes.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"589cde5adcd9988c2589bd9d3791f4e5e194a414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/589cde5adcd9988c2589bd9d3791f4e5e194a414"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDczZWZjNWQwMzQ3MjA1YzE0ODZiOWFlNGRmYWY0ZWU5N2FjOTFhN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac","sha":"44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac"}],"sha":"73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/73efc5d0347205c1486b9ae4dfaf4ee97ac91a7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:31:48Z","email":"sam.hardi.me@gmail.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:09:17Z","email":"117673449+SamHardi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sam Hardi"},"message":"fix(observability): refuse incomplete queries with a 400, never a 500\n\nA logs search or analytics query missing part of its shape was either\nanswered (a logs search without a time range ran unbounded) or failed with\na 500: a time-series without `interval` hit an NPE, an unknown metric,\nmeasure, facet or sort order, or a lowercase `desc`, threw on `valueOf`,\nand a null entry in `filters`, `metrics`, `sorts` or `ranges` threw while\nmapping the body.\n\nEvery such request is now refused with a 400 and an\n`observability.query.*` technical code:\n\n- both time-range bounds are required on logs and analytics;\n- `metrics` must not be empty, `interval` must be present and positive;\n- an array entry must not be null;\n- unknown metric, measure, facet and sort order names are named in the\n  error. The sort order is read case-insensitively, like operators.\n\nThe analytics query is checked, names and engine rules alike, before the\nearly return taken when the caller can read no API, so a malformed query\ngets the same 400 whatever the caller can read. The OpenAPI states the\nrequired fields and the causes of a 400.\n\nRefs OBS-68","tree":{"sha":"d66e82d1a7fbdc70d252b31cfe68ca6e3e8aa285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/trees/d66e82d1a7fbdc70d252b31cfe68ca6e3e8aa285"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/git/commits/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117673449?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamHardi","id":117673449,"login":"SamHardi","node_id":"U_kgDOBwON6Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamHardi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac","node_id":"C_kwDOAizBENoAKDQ0YzhlYzkzMmNhZmZhYmJhZDI3MDNjZGNjZGMwOWRmZTFkZjQ0YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commit/c17c4a6f32a16221ab929475ca7d221dc23453fa","sha":"c17c4a6f32a16221ab929475ca7d221dc23453fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/c17c4a6f32a16221ab929475ca7d221dc23453fa"}],"sha":"44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gravitee-io/gravitee-api-management/commits/44c8ec932caffabbad2703cdccdc09dfe1df44ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12494047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kovaren","id":12494047,"login":"kovaren","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNDk0MDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kovaren/repos","s