oragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: move For Evaluators into the specialized personas row.\n\nKeep the primary home grid as the four core personas and place Evaluators with the compact specialized chips.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: drop duplicate for-evaluators pages; link to existing guides.\n\nPoint the For Evaluators persona at the canonical Quick Start Evaluation page and the marketing sign-up for the 1-hour preview. Remove Marketo implementation detail from user-facing docs copy.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: nest 1-hour cloud preview under Quick Start Evaluation.\n\nMove the existing Docker/Azure guide into a folder and add a plain-language 1-hour preview page beside it so both appear in the Deployment Guide sidebar.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: drop duplicate Try Mattermost CTA on For Evaluators.\n\nThe Start here card already links to the 1-hour cloud preview page.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: link Demo Library from the For Evaluators start grid.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: drop For from the Evaluators persona title.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: make Quick Start Evaluation an overview with child pages.\n\nKeep the section index high-level and move the Docker/Azure instructions to a sibling page beside the 1-hour cloud preview.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: split Docker and Azure evaluation pages and mute the preview CTA.\n\nUse brand sand instead of marigold for the 1-hour preview button, put Evaluators last among specialized personas, drop the redundant Important callout, and split Docker vs Azure like other deployment methods.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: list the three evaluator try-it options on the home chip.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <