ere card already links to the 1-hour cloud preview page.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: link Demo Library from the For Evaluators start grid.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: drop For from the Evaluators persona title.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: make Quick Start Evaluation an overview with child pages.\n\nKeep the section index high-level and move the Docker/Azure instructions to a sibling page beside the 1-hour cloud preview.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: split Docker and Azure evaluation pages and mute the preview CTA.\n\nUse brand sand instead of marigold for the 1-hour preview button, put Evaluators last among specialized personas, drop the redundant Important callout, and split Docker vs Azure like other deployment methods.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* docs: list the three evaluator try-it options on the home chip.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx16cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxikQABmHI8ughiOnC3SMEPW3eZeo\nR4P5pB2b6osn89WiIEtioF3x4oyEUB3tuRdKQ1z3U58dmkITrvtTAo6mMXoa47cz\no8KF5jsbhnojmOtbCvfPs9SjR9NTEfO20phGZM2NhL4HE261/K3erlud5yBA+tvP\ndjohYjljriDbSF2LWbGtUQ5RXCSejaNN3cPI3nYU8GLTaFaXRi56ZtqSCIAvpSkO\n+Zd/7GESyJBbU6oVYn+yrf3O7QmSn2reAhXhROvK28AlPHDr9TLPdDVF8yjhfiP2\n5dPbtFK4rI8DIFNyucr37oWWIw2TWph4AaXpXnrxRgJ3G2AOHrXEVGGZtO5qc1LY\nUvFn6rAF20DiM1LVDkYvm3swMuYeD79hd4E+O4Wc/VU8dCYZw6q/Zdfs7DNoLZIj\nz0KpBP1WwH1s2GNioe+HJhWLYvSrVto9paK1icI94CMPwwJa9mQWv4np3o/ENScK\nxne93OERhpPJwQs4/yVLGfM/UnGraob21Lg/ZUt+msS882EbdC8+yLpnIiwEPKtv\nIyA9i5vdA0wWKXmYETG6Fb+apYvMGo1EVsCzJwjuVDit7RBpUxS9bX+1HjpsPGm+\na/jKdA0004Cl5K3mr2aFr75SzAbVNHL50cOWtoHyK+0fKrl2Ea7VNVu90djTZNTB\n0dRhcJW3SeVC0DfwmQXi\n=RcWD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T09:13:0