//api.github.com/users/ewwollesen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ewwollesen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ewwollesen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/f132e4afd3fa9191631b009e80726e2c932c3dfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:02:50Z","email":"50209602+ewwollesen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wayne Wollesen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:02:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70991] Bump moment-timezone to 0.6.4 for the 2026 time zone changes (#38849)\n\nmoment-timezone 0.5.38 bundles IANA tzdata 2022e, so the webapp''s\nmoment.tz offset math misses the 2026 rule changes. British Columbia,\nAlberta and the Northwest Territories stop observing DST on\n2026-11-01, and Morocco moved to permanent UTC on 2026-09-20.\n\n0.6.4 bundles tzdata 2026d, the first release that covers all four.\nThe mattermost-redux range is bumped too, since ^0.5.38 excludes 0.6.x.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23bd7bc602d5a73c4cf22c77b9f5d527b4c428d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/23bd7bc602d5a73c4cf22c77b9f5d527b4c428d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/f132e4afd3fa9191631b009e80726e2c932c3dfb","verification":{"payload":"tree 23bd7bc602d5a73c4cf22c77b9f5d527b4c428d5\nparent bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22\nauthor Wayne Wollesen <50209602+ewwollesen@users.noreply.github.com> 1791205370 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791205370 +0200\n\n[MM-70991] Bump moment-timezone to 0.6.4 for the 2026 time zone changes (#38849)\n\nmoment-timezone 0.5.38 bundles IANA tzdata 2022e, so the webapp''s\nmoment.tz offset math misses the 2026 rule changes. British Columbia,\nAlberta and the Northwest Territories stop observing DST on\n2026-11-01, and Morocco moved to permanent UTC on 2026-09-20.\n\n0.6.4 bundles tzdata 2026d, the first release that covers all four.\nThe mattermost-redux range is bumped too, since ^0.5.38 excludes 0.6.x.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw5/6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX9wQAC1k+QjEMQZtk9Qs4PEIVYdW\nC5hrxKHPVp00N8DJjrLAlugrkDti1jy3CJ+kbR84lZl64TxJEp5btsLrWumJJcpA\nX7eeabLvmqSA6ODFAEN7IX+lS7gkygZHYwfhCEMTr1xxmX016JPv8bQEvnB/yL+x\nlV8A/3/kdpLAepAB12LlbqL7f3IeohSGExWIAYfg4ZDUfOdJ4Tax6JSnzYiPhjpv\n+v7YQE37cpD6MmhVR0INJtaooaiRzUtnKpvOpTNXEpVCf9r1yIA+AuKlV9ZRaY3X\nea6an2cEAYlzO+0gBiMyhL4PTxZKjnDgK+Y1zXmhToLB8gDHCDK2gT7i6SoGVCO2\n9fOLVDDGI+tUwhZthVFRS9j88ai6j6ERSvnA/YcutzkNdWw/ClQMTm40hy/5y1n1\nQlsS8L3ouvW8Rd+YnRexEFW71OYz+Nt7UKihhFHZ6a4y4oJ0+CdWgRuyUxi2X0aK\nHlcaYKdxfRFbjctbR/+elxjkFpz78+FPwhQR5jVuDTonrG9UE8Gu5VSDV+RvlnDs\nnajCthPjtg1nr/rh7ZSowP70AH85UpGADyGYKfKXiOxZoj+87+b94sjOMS9N9Dfy\n3zPneOlO2Zf+1yR/cT1o/CP7UM/xXaqTRLlWdwv5UWL5+7EBxN1bpj/WVVWnQRcj\n220PLIpvAoBFXWWkVAtR\n=oLnq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T13:02:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/f132e4afd3fa9191631b009e80726e2c932c3dfb","node_id":"C_kwDOAjtrA9oAKGYxMzJlNGFmZDNmYTkxOTE2MzFiMDA5ZTgwNzI2ZTJjOTMyYzNkZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22","sha":"bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22"}],"sha":"f132e4afd3fa9191631b009e80726e2c932c3dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/f132e4afd3fa9191631b009e80726e2c932c3dfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","id":206951365,"login":"cursor[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:21:52Z","email":"206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cursor[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:21:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"MM-70640: Update EXIF metadata handling when reading image orientation (#38739)\n\n* MM-70640: Update EXIF metadata handling when reading image orientation\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: match max login attempts e2e to current login error banner\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Address PR feedback: 0 answered, 2 resolved, 0 declined\n\n- Add worst-case PNG/TIFF/WebP cases to TestGetImageOrientationLargeMetadata\n  exercising the most expensive input the tag-size limit still allows, under\n  the existing time bound; make the payload-size assertion per-payload.\n- Revert max_login_attempts.spec.ts to master, restoring the exact\n  full-message lockout assertion.\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after unrelated Cypress flake\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after unrelated Enterprise test flake\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* fix: set webhook username/icon override via API in Cypress helper\n\nThe Integration Management Save button often stays disabled after a\nforced radio check, which flakes MM-T622 after in-run retest.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Apply EXIF orientation when setting a team icon\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Return an error when the team icon file cannot be rewound\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add description for emoji too-large-to-process translation string\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after module proxy failure\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after FIPS module proxy failure\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Loosen time bound for worst-case EXIF orientation tests under -race\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Use the server SiteURL for permalinks in unread post list scroll spec\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: David Krauser <david@krauser.org>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"13ae2b55543d2fb071f248dfdda3383e7b5b92ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/13ae2b55543d2fb071f248dfdda3383e7b5b92ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/bce346e7948d2f36bb2b2416c6af74d618870e22","verification":{"payload":"tree 13ae2b55543d2fb071f248dfdda3383e7b5b92ac\nparent e32d8734cb082a1cc4ffed6eb827342d28b1fc8f\nauthor cursor[bot] <206951365+cursor[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791195712 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791195712 +0000\n\nMM-70640: Update EXIF metadata handling when reading image orientation (#38739)\n\n* MM-70640: Update EXIF metadata handling when reading image orientation\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: match max login attempts e2e to current login error banner\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Address PR feedback: 0 answered, 2 resolved, 0 declined\n\n- Add worst-case PNG/TIFF/WebP cases to TestGetImageOrientationLargeMetadata\n  exercising the most expensive input the tag-size limit still allows, under\n  the existing time bound; make the payload-size assertion per-payload.\n- Revert max_login_attempts.spec.ts to master, restoring the exact\n  full-message lockout assertion.\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after unrelated Cypress flake\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after unrelated Enterprise test flake\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* fix: set webhook username/icon override via API in Cypress helper\n\nThe Integration Management Save button often stays disabled after a\nforced radio check, which flakes MM-T622 after in-run retest.\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Apply EXIF orientation when setting a team icon\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Return an error when the team icon file cannot be rewound\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Add description for emoji too-large-to-process translation string\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after module proxy failure\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* chore: retrigger CI after FIPS module proxy failure\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n* Loosen time bound for worst-case EXIF orientation tests under -race\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Use the server SiteURL for permalinks in unread post list scroll spec\n\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: mattermost-code <matty-code@mattermost.com>\nCo-authored-by: David Krauser <david@krauser.org>\nCo-authored-by: Mattermost Build <build@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw3pACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6IgQAIKeJFaGVUEkplllWDjNUZyC\nsU3atHVfjyBzhXMx6NDuzQ4hfhOmNLAUgA79DMuWRw/2N/OlTwGgyzV7YW7fQscU\nuElbwJ/OkFLyP6qVv5LBsMfAQVqMxBPMbW7012zTeua8AvDtV3l32kUI5poGW07C\njy/1ji8kFbyGZrSddDZvXbUsj+a7KlNwB8pJmYNxhc4Z0buG34Zq7+mHJyDnVtmZ\nQQlEgNXSYavzJWQhUT7AwbBy5r3ZfFDBvf3CrwBrf2bUzc0bReoCLPQ8UE3U2xY0\nNdLRQ6z5lnP2fctUdWCNGOHmik0/dsS7rYPbFUnvmyFkPiYn6dgbXNkWH1tk4js8\nlqrnoctXPmmr9aDS82KOWqFihlerrwQlClgcpyPgWLgI5VS42ulj5kEKsvPXSTMv\nLOzI1iFdw/1d9RSSJ7MAPO8mRHNeLzn5x1zHQY8rdtQJZsUhm+TMCsqtIns