b13","sha":"af4c3cfde668e006981efa29ba740791eb03fb13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/af4c3cfde668e006981efa29ba740791eb03fb13"}],"sha":"05a293c603f9909565a8793148a5f7a08b4d3274","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/05a293c603f9909565a8793148a5f7a08b4d3274"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5334504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saturninoabril","id":5334504,"login":"saturninoabril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzQ1MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/af4c3cfde668e006981efa29ba740791eb03fb13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:06:56Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:06:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix flaky autotranslation e2e tests and duplicate \"AI Actions\" button (#38965)\n\n* Fix flaky autotranslation ''unsupported language'' e2e tests\n\nAvoid changing the test user''s locale to ''fr'', which also switches\nthe webapp UI language and broke literal English text assertions\nonce fr.json gained a translation. Exclude ''en'' from TargetLanguages\ninstead, and re-apply config across reloads to guard against\nconcurrent initSetup() resets.\n\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix duplicate ''AI Actions'' accessible button in AI Actions menu\n\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"07555b4cc697cf7dcb13498e0a1a3ed1ace5cc37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/07555b4cc697cf7dcb13498e0a1a3ed1ace5cc37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/af4c3cfde668e006981efa29ba740791eb03fb13","verification":{"payload":"tree 07555b4cc697cf7dcb13498e0a1a3ed1ace5cc37\nparent 85e95437ab3e7632017cd3cf2ec06e4785467ae7\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1791007616 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791007616 +0800\n\nFix flaky autotranslation e2e tests and duplicate \"AI Actions\" button (#38965)\n\n* Fix flaky autotranslation ''unsupported language'' e2e tests\n\nAvoid changing the test user''s locale to ''fr'', which also switches\nthe webapp UI language and broke literal English text assertions\nonce fr.json gained a translation. Exclude ''en'' from TargetLanguages\ninstead, and re-apply config across reloads to guard against\nconcurrent initSetup() resets.\n\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix duplicate ''AI Actions'' accessible button in AI Actions menu\n\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: sabril <saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwJuACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnkUQAKfPDZyGWU8WCCJ/ldnBeue6\nMXLO4LMlvYFRwkvv7JR3fvWMS/EauPt