st/commit/6338ffdc768e8eedcb8604a11e4207347911787e","node_id":"C_kwDOAjtrA9oAKDYzMzhmZmRjNzY4ZThlZWRjYjg2MDRhMTFlNDIwNzM0NzkxMTc4N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/70c1732d783fde4cbc7a88632721f4e134a57ec4","sha":"70c1732d783fde4cbc7a88632721f4e134a57ec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/70c1732d783fde4cbc7a88632721f4e134a57ec4"}],"sha":"6338ffdc768e8eedcb8604a11e4207347911787e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/6338ffdc768e8eedcb8604a11e4207347911787e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1023171?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lieut-data","id":1023171,"login":"lieut-data","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjMxNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lieut-data","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/70c1732d783fde4cbc7a88632721f4e134a57ec4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:41:56Z","email":"jesse.hallam@gmail.com","name":"Jesse Hallam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:41:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bring back eight dropped locales as (Experimental) languages and fill their catalogs (#38944)\n\n* Restore eight dropped locales as (Experimental) languages\n\nBrings back the webapp and server catalogs for Danish, Czech, Croatian,\nLithuanian, Norwegian Bokmål, Portuguese (Portugal), Finnish and Belarusian\nexactly as they stood before e9379690d5 removed them, and wires them in as\nordinary supported locales: the webapp languages map, the generated\nimports.ts, and the server''s supportedLocales list.\n\nThese were the catalogs with a real human-translated foundation (60-93% of\nthe user-facing strings for the first five, 20-31% for hr/fi/pt). Danish is\noffered without a tag; the rest are labelled (Experimental) in the picker.\nThe EnableExperimentalLocales setting is not reinstated.\n\nThe catalogs are restored verbatim here; syncing them to today''s en.json and\nfilling the remaining strings follow in separate commits.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Sync the restored catalogs to en.json and clear strings that fail the checkers\n\nRuns the translate-i18n sync (apply_translations.mjs with no payload) over the\neight restored catalogs: every id en.json no longer has is pruned, and every\nid they lack is seeded as \"\" so the gap is a value the worklists can read.\n\nThe strings that fail check_icu.mjs or mmgotool i18n verify -- 209 webapp\nstrings that drop or invent a variable, demote a plural, or do not parse, and\n11 server strings with a stale template token or an empty or unused plural\ncategory -- are reset to \"\" so the translation pass rewrites them rather than\nshipping a string that throws at runtime.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Describe the 17 webapp strings that had no translator description\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fill the Danish catalogs and add the Danish glossary\n\nTranslates the 1,155 webapp and 358 server strings the restored da catalogs\nlacked, following the translate-i18n skill: a Danish glossary derived from\nthe majority renderings already in the catalog, per-chunk validation with\nthe skill''s validator (ICU parse, variable and tag parity, plural\ncategories, the apostrophe trap), then apply_translations.mjs.\n\nBoth catalogs are now complete and pass check_icu.mjs and\nmmgotool i18n verify.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add glossaries for the seven experimental locales and translate their first 700 strings each\n\nEach locale''s glossary carries the 122 shared terms with targets derived from\nthe majority rendering already in that catalog, and notes recording the\ninconsistent alternates and known mistranslations that a translation pass\nmust not propagate.\n\nThe webapp translations are the first two validated chunks per locale\n(admin console strings, which sort first in en.json); the rest follow.\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 1,050 more Croatian webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 2,100 more Finnish webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Czech webapp catalog (1,716 strings)\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 350 Czech server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 1,050 more Norwegian Bokmål webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 2,185 more Lithuanian webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Belarusian webapp catalog and translate 700 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 4,200 more European Portuguese webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Czech server catalog (650 strings)\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Belarusian server catalog (175 strings)\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 2,100 more Finnish webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 2,100 more Croatian webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 700 more Lithuanian webapp strings and 1,050 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Lithuanian webapp catalog and translate 350 more server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Norwegian Bokmål webapp catalog and translate 700 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the European Portuguese webapp catalog and translate 700 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 1,400 more Finnish webapp strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 350 more Lithuanian server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 700 more European Portuguese server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 350 more Finnish webapp strings and 287 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Finish the Finnish webapp catalog and translate 700 more server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 2,095 more Norwegian Bokmål server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 1,320 more Lithuanian server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Jesse Hallam <lieut-data@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Translate 1,373 more Croatian webapp strings and 1,400 server strings\n\nCo-authored-by: Je