rmost/mattermost/commits/2ab94ccaabe9a7d9595cc31376e37c5f127a8956/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:46:00Z","email":"angelos.kyratzakos@mattermost.com","name":"Angelos Kyratzakos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:46:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Docs: document Aurora reader endpoint vs instance endpoints for DataSourceReplicas (#38817)\n\n* Recommend Aurora reader endpoint for DataSourceReplicas\n\nHardcoded reader instance endpoints go stale when readers are added or removed and don''t work with Aurora Replica Auto Scaling. Default to the cluster reader endpoint with a short ConnMaxLifetimeMilliseconds, keep instance endpoints as an alternative, and clarify that pool limits apply per DataSourceReplicas entry.\n\n* Present both Aurora replica configurations with pros and cons","tree":{"sha":"cbbac78e4e1e51abbc95857644efefbb248d904a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/cbbac78e4e1e51abbc95857644efefbb248d904a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/2ab94ccaabe9a7d9595cc31376e37c5f127a8956","verification":{"payload":"tree cbbac78e4e1e51abbc95857644efefbb248d904a\nparent 91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75\nauthor Angelos Kyratzakos <angelos.kyratzakos@mattermost.com> 1790819160 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790819160 -0700\n\nDocs: document Aurora reader endpoint vs instance endpoints for DataSourceReplicas (#38817)\n\n* Recommend Aurora reader endpoint for DataSourceReplicas\n\nHardcoded reader instance endpoints go stale when readers are added or removed and don''t work with Aurora Replica Auto Scaling. Default to the cluster reader endpoint with a short ConnMaxLifetimeMilliseconds, keep instance endpoints as an alternative, and clarify that pool limits apply per DataSourceReplicas entry.\n\n* Present both Aurora replica configurations with pros and cons","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE----