https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75","sha":"91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75"}],"sha":"2ab94ccaabe9a7d9595cc31376e37c5f127a8956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/2ab94ccaabe9a7d9595cc31376e37c5f127a8956"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26745764?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NateSchlossberg","id":26745764,"login":"NateSchlossberg","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NzQ1NzY0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateSchlossberg","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:47:45Z","email":"nate.schlossberg@mattermost.com","name":"Nate Schlossberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T00:47:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[MM-70692] New ABAC Permission Policy: Burn on Read (#38656)\n\n* Add new feature flag and abac permission policy for BoR\n\n* Rename HasPermissionToFileAction to more general HasPermissionToChannelAction\n\n* Added feature flag for BoR Permission Action, added front-end controls for adding BoR actions to policy\n\n* Added enforcement of BurnOnRead for ABAC at request time\n\n* Added webapp client-side rendering of create BoR permission\n\n* Additional server tests to ensure proper error response for rejected burn-on-read\n\n* When BoR is disabled, disable send button for remaining BoR drafts and reschedule/edit/sendNow buttons for scheduled BoR posts\n\n* Added e2e tests for general feature coverage\n\n* Disable send and schedule buttons in the client in the draft row for lingering BoR drafts when ABAC BoR is revoked\n\n* Update e2e test for BoR control to be isVisible vs Attached for better coverage\n\n* Properly disable BoR from wysiwyg editor\n\n* Style fix\n\n* Fix scheduled_post_test to verify post type cannot be changed\n\n* Removed Feature Flag for ABAC BurnOnRead\n\n* Updated documentation for Burn-On-Read permission policy\n\n* coderabbit feedback - minor test improvements\n\n* make keyboard submission consistent for BoR\n\n* fixed broken unit test\n\n* Add required feature flag for testing BoR ABAC Channel Policy\n\n* added clarity in documentation to behavior of burn-on-read policy being revoked\n\n* Added disclaimer about ABAC permission policies and where they apply and do not\n\n* Added requirement for channel permission policies in documentation - based on review feedback\n\n* Added translation description to new error message\n\n* Renamed merged-in method calls to HasPermissionToFileAction\n\n* Added missing descriptions to webapp/en.json\n\n* Fix typo in mock\n\n* minor typo fix in docs\n\n* Add missing label for BoR action in Policy Table\n\n* Update en.json with updated description text\n\n* Update e2e test to fix updated permission policy description text","tree":{"sha":"225b13a3e6afa5a557081d15e6f7e9999b749442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/225b13a3e6afa5a557081d15e6f7e9999b749442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/91b4450e49cd6e6b427fac629a71705aed793a75","verification":{"payload":"tree 225b13a3e6afa5a557081d15e6f7e9999b749442\nparent 24ef18fda7ca58b8ef59c8dd880fd17bccabe12b\nauthor Nate Schlossberg <nate.schlossberg@mattermost.com> 1790815665 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790815665 -0700\n\n[MM-70692] New ABAC Permission Policy: Burn on Read (#38656)\n\n* Add new feature flag and abac permission policy for BoR\n\n* Rename HasPermissionToFileAction to more general HasPermissionToChannelAction\n\n* Added feature flag for BoR Permission Action, added front-end controls for adding BoR actions to policy\n\n* Added enforcement of BurnOnRead for ABAC at request time\n\n* Added webapp client-side rendering of create BoR permission\n\n* Additional server tests to ensure proper error response for rejected burn-on-read\n\n* When BoR is disabled, disable send button for remaining BoR drafts and reschedule/edit/sendNow buttons for scheduled BoR posts\n\n* Added e2e tests for general feature coverage\n\n* Disable send and schedule buttons in the client in the draft row for lingering BoR drafts when ABAC BoR is revoked\n\n* Update e2e test for BoR control to be isVisible vs Attached for better coverage\n\n* Properly disable BoR from wysiwyg editor\n\n* Style fix\n\n* Fix scheduled_post_test to verify post type cannot be changed\n\n* Removed Feature Flag for ABAC BurnOnRead\n\n* Updated documentation for Burn-On-Read permission policy\n\n* coderabbit feedback - minor test improvements\n\n* make keyboard submission consistent for BoR\n\n* fixed broken unit test\n\n* Add required feature flag for testing BoR ABAC Channel Policy\n\n* added clarity in documentation to behavior of burn-on-read policy being revoked\n\n* Added disclaimer about ABAC permission policies and where they apply and do not\n\n* Added requirement for channel permission policies in documentation - based on review feedback\n\n* Added translation description to 