termost/commits/24ef18fda7ca58b8ef59c8dd880fd17bccabe12b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/785518?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JulienTant","id":785518,"login":"JulienTant","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTUxOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulienTant","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/f747d6242a6d32eb9ac406f0b992384bf2f7857d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:19:25Z","email":"785518+JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Julien Tant"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:19:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix Attribute Management listing permissions, Classification license gate, and sync-source cascade (#38830)\n\n* Honor Attribute Management page disabled state on the listing\n\nWire the schema isDisabled prop through GlobalAttributes so non-sysadmins\nsee a disabled New attribute button, View instead of Edit, and a disabled\nDelete action. Also align the Classification row license gate with the\nClassification Markings route (Enterprise Advanced).\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Point Attribute-Based Access help links at Attribute Management\n\nThe old system_attributes/user_attributes URLs only redirect now. Update\nthe ABAC enable help text and related empty-state CTAs to manage_attributes\nand rename the link label to Attribute Management.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Cascade template LDAP/SAML sync source edits to linked Users fields\n\nLDAP sync reads attrs.ldap/attrs.saml on the Users field, which were only\ncopied from the template at create time. When Save updates the template\nsync source, also PATCH the already-linked Users field so existing sync\nmappings stay in sync.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Playwright coverage for Attribute Management admin fixes\n\nCover the non-sysadmin read-only listing, ABAC help link to\nAttribute Management, and cascading LDAP sync-source edits onto\nalready-linked Users fields.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix Prettier formatting in attribute_management_link e2e spec\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add JSDoc @objective to attribute_management_link e2e spec\n\nlint:test-docs requires a preceding JSDoc with @objective for tagged\ntest() declarations; the file-level comment was not attached to the test.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove low-value ABAC help-link Playwright e2e\n\nThe href change is a static admin_definition/i18n string; listing\npermissions and sync-source cascade remain covered by e2e.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Hide Classification row when Classification Markings is unreachable\n\nBelow Enterprise Advanced (or with the flag off), do not show the\nClassification template as an ordinary Edit/Delete row — hide it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix ABAC help link navigation to Attribute Management\n\nUse React Router Link with an absolute admin_console path so the\nhelp-text control navigates inside the SPA instead of a relative\nplain anchor that did not reliably change the route.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fill missing i18n description for emoji too-large-to-process error\n\nEnterprise Check i18n fails when extract adds an empty description for\napi.emoji.upload.large_image.too_large_to_process.app_error (introduced\nwithout one in #38716). Add a translator-facing description so extract\nstays clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ed7627a79af847ec1767502a2313fb5a9a0fc81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/7ed7627a79af847ec1767502a2313fb5a9a0fc81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/f747d6242a6d32eb9ac406f0b992384bf2f7857d","verification":{"payload":"tree 7ed7627a79af847ec1767502a2313fb5a9a0fc81\nparent 0f35dda92b8e9b10ed42241d2f4dee83e1b9b5a6\nauthor Julien Tant <785518+JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com> 1790788765 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790788765 +0000\n\nFix Attribute Management listing permissions, Classification license gate, and sync-source cascade (#38830)\n\n* Honor Attribute Management page disabled state on the listing\n\nWire the schema isDisabled prop through GlobalAttributes so non-sysadmins\nsee a disabled New attribute button, View instead of Edit, and a disabled\nDelete action. Also align the Classification row license gate with the\nClassification Markings route (Enterprise Advanced).\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Point Attribute-Based Access help links at Attribute Management\n\nThe old system_attributes/user_attributes URLs only redirect now. Update\nthe ABAC enable help text and related empty-state CTAs to manage_attributes\nand rename the link label to Attribute Management.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Cascade template LDAP/SAML sync source edits to linked Users fields\n\nLDAP sync reads attrs.ldap/attrs.saml on the Users field, which were only\ncopied from the template at create time. When Save updates the template\nsync source, also PATCH the already-linked Users field so existing sync\nmappings stay in sync.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add Playwright coverage for Attribute Management admin fixes\n\nCover the non-sysadmin read-only listing, ABAC help link to\nAttribute Management, and cascading LDAP sync-source edits onto\nalready-linked Users fields.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix Prettier formatting in attribute_management_link e2e spec\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add JSDoc @objective to attribute_management_link e2e spec\n\nlint:test-docs requires a preceding JSDoc with @objective for tagged\ntest() declarations; the file-level comment was not attached to the test.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove low-value ABAC help-link Playwright e2e\n\nThe href change is a static admin_definition/i18n string; listing\npermissions and sync-source cascade remain covered by e2e.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Hide Classification row when Classification Markings is unreachable\n\nBelow Enterprise Advanced (or with the flag off), do not show the\nClassification template as an ordinary Edit/Delete row — hide it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Tant <JulienTant@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix ABAC help link navigation to Attribute Management\n\nUse React Router Link with an absolute admin_console path so the\nhelp-text control navigates inside the SPA instead of a relative\nplain anchor that did not reliably change the route.\n\nCo-au