thub.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/8bfa298a54cba976311164492f4be9e62a039389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:32:51Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T03:32:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[E2E/Playwright] Add password, MFA, authentication-method, and claim tests (#38520)\n\n* Add Playwright password, MFA, authentication-method, and claim tests\n\nAdds password requirements, MFA visibility/enforcement, System Console\nauthentication-method column, and authentication-transfer claim coverage.\nDeletes the ported Cypress specs.\n\nLocates the user row by exact username instead of assuming index 0, and waits\nfor the users-report response matching the search term before reading it.\nAnchors the password-length error locator so it can''t match the longer\ncomplexity message, and asserts the length reset to the compiled default (5).\nMM-T1778 skips when testcontainers isn''t available, since its enforced-MFA\ncleanup depends on the local mmctl path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cypress override-setting test pollution and gh api --slurp/--jq CI script bug\n\n- helpers.js: make enableUsernameAndIconOverrideInt idempotent so a sibling\n  spec leaving EnablePostUsernameOverride/EnablePostIconOverride already\n  enabled doesn''t leave #saveSetting permanently disabled (30s timeout in\n  disallow_username_profile_override_spec.js). Replace the spec''s dead\n  mattermost.com icon fixture URL (404) with a stable in-repo asset.\n- e2e-tests-override-status.yml / e2e-tests-verified-label.yml: gh api\n  rejects --slurp combined with --jq in one call; split into a pipe to a\n  separate jq invocation instead.\n- e2e-tests-playwright.yml: bump playwright-full workers 20 -> 30.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"808d6b09f80a901a46d5f00787f85a3e20ab6792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/808d6b09f80a901a46d5f00787f85a3e20ab6792"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/8bfa298a54cba976311164492f4be9e62a039389","verification":{"payload":"tree 808d6b09f80a901a46d5f00787f85a3e20ab6792\nparent b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1790566371 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790566371 +0800\n\n[E2E/Playwright] Add password, MFA, authentication-method, and claim tests (#38520)\n\n* Add Playwright password, MFA, authentication-method, and claim tests\n\nAdds password requirements, MFA visibility/enforcement, System Console\nauthentication-method column, and authentication-transfer claim coverage.\nDeletes the ported Cypress specs.\n\nLocates the user row by exact username instead of assuming index 0, and waits\nfor the users-report response matching the search term before reading it.\nAnchors the password-length error locator so it can''t match the longer\ncomplexity message, and asserts the length reset to the compiled default (5).\nMM-T1778 skips when testcontainers isn''t available, since its enforced-MFA\ncleanup depends on the local mmctl path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix Cypress override-setting test pollution and gh api --slurp/--jq CI script bug\n\n- helpers.js: make enableUsernameAndIconOverrideInt idempotent so a sibling\n  spec leaving EnablePostUsernameOverride/EnablePostIconOverride already\n  enabled doesn''t leave #saveSetting permanently disabled (30s timeout in\n  disallow_username_profile_override_spec.js). Replace the spec''s dead\n  mattermost.com icon fixture URL (404) with a stable in-repo asset.\n- e2e-tests-override-status.yml / e2e-tests-verified-label.yml: gh api\n  rejects --slurp combined with --jq in one call; split into a pipe to a\n  separate jq invocation instead.\n- e2e-tests-playwright.yml: bump playwright-full workers 20 -> 30.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqud/jCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACSsQAGMasivxQMx5JPq7yV6XUMOe\nMFszbiRoP85hoS8iqrX4Uk87i1UAfUlidXcMxCsPBRzT9IeAHMShPwboIo9qErcx\nbpHZn1XgO7KQnfdE8A7FdALVAKhha0UE2XyrpgOVonIFTVkn5cO0Y5Fo5aT/SGcq\nPoB2TPq/GNUBr5vPT47VKoKf4k2IXQ1ZT9/ZK9+xQXgZZ2L1GXg2dwptLBgPezIC\nRfgPy2v3Cv1Fo1YUECfSxtHPSaKga+qjlbXQOfIgM0VcSA4v+N2FQKDzGE5mN/5R\nzvDYObp0LCdH6xw9FT8CRStmxwZ0SAxyv+dVQOwjtV68XzHH82xOyZSUqjE4kiwq\nVOATxMmYw1e2J5IWmOcgKplKNp4gC1CQCsjYyc+uoeFqD6upJXB2uBe/yYoz8VSd\nA6IAZ3f4XolvlI8gFAZuyPmNwsbTtDbr/H7E0H6G+pV3sg+Unyvp+iB6cJnVJKXR\nt6Okp+zqVh8A6LX8xu4TFfuMgTATGq6i0s4Bj+E7RLPERzxuYqXM0Cdt1Wg3p1Av\ns/83Nqvlsq2hRf6tULxmWYPGqSJGGBScDTuC/d3UMtP3HBIfqnRmr054MhEywqTZ\n90covEcFV3LKIxAghR2ayxCsUJJcyyzEXV1NdQ8AfD0O1AvYuWAUJ3XHmuJLEeU6\niwmwVmucLT7ZdzwPjo1Z\n=UqD1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T03:32:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/8bfa298a54cba976311164492f4be9e62a039389","node_id":"C_kwDOAjtrA9oAKDhiZmEyOThhNTRjYmE5NzYzMTExNjQ0OTJmNGJlOWU2MmEwMzkzODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/commit/b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43","sha":"b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43"}],"sha":"8bfa298a54cba976311164492f4be9e62a039389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/8bfa298a54cba976311164492f4be9e62a039389"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5334504?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saturninoabril","id":5334504,"login":"saturninoabril","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzQ1MDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saturninoabril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:44:41Z","email":"5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"sabril"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:44:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[E2E/Playwright] Add login and auth-policy tests and delete ported Cypress specs (#38519)\n\n* Add Playwright login and auth-policy tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds email/username login, sign-in placeholder settings, and account-creation/\ndomain/signup policy coverage. Deletes the ported Cypress authentication and\nhide-create-account specs.\n\nAsserts the post-login redirect directly instead of navigating to the channel\nfirst, and restores LdapSettings.Enable alongside EmailSettings in MM-T1761''s\ncleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply suggestion from @yasserfaraazkhan\n\nCo-authored-by: yasser khan <attitude3cena.yf@gmail.com>\n\n* Restore MM-T1766 domain-restriction cleanup\n\nThe committed suggestion restored Email/LDAP flags from originalConfig\nin MM-T1766, which never captures that snapshot and does not patch LDAP.\nPut back the RestrictCreationToDomains reset this test actually needs.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Use Locator type instead of ReturnType<Page[''getByText'']> pattern\n\nLocator is the correct, explicit type for Playwright locator properties;\nReturnType<Page[...]> is an unnecessary and less readable indirection.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Rename ShouldVerifyEmailPage to VerifyEmailPage\n\nMatch the plain <Noun>Page naming convention used by every other page\nobject (LoginPage, SignupPage, SelectTeamPage, etc.); the ''Should'' prefix\nwas an outlier with no functional meaning.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* set default IntuneSettings\n\n* fix session attributes specs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: yasser khan <attitude3cena.yf@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","tree":{"sha":"98ba603c3fcce55f23d8009ac8352578552dcad9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/98ba603c3fcce55f23d8009ac8352578552dcad9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/b5c970cdbb4a6b007d373421d5511747e520cf43","verification":{"payload":"tree 98ba603c3fcce55f23d8009ac8352578552dcad9\nparent 1f33d75c0c2f9d26cd9be109ae66b24c0bc3f28b\nauthor sabril <5334504+saturninoabril@users.noreply.github.com> 1790563481 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790563481 +0800\n\n[E2E/Playwright] Add login and auth-policy tests and delete ported Cypress specs (#38519)\n\n* Add Playwright login and auth-policy tests, delete ported Cypress specs\n\nAdds email/username login, sign-in placeholder settings, and account-creation/\ndomain/signup policy coverage. Deletes the ported Cypress authentication and\nhide-create-account specs.\n\nAsserts the post-login redirect directly instead of navigating to the channel\nfirst, and restores LdapSettings.Enable alongside EmailSettings in MM-T1761''s\ncleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply suggestion from @yasserfaraazkhan\n\nCo-authored-by: yasser khan <attitude3cena.yf@gmail.com>\n\n* Restore MM-T1766 domain-restriction cleanup\n\nThe committed suggestion restored Email/LDAP flags from originalConfig\nin MM-T1766, which never captures that snapshot and does not patch LDAP.\nPut back the RestrictCreationToDomains reset this test actually needs.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Use Locator type instead of ReturnType<Page[''getByText'']> pattern\n\nLocator is the correct, explicit type for Playwright locator properties;\nReturnType<Page[...]> is an unnecessary and less readable indirection.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* Rename ShouldVerifyEmailPage to VerifyEmailPage\n\nMatch the plain <Noun>Page naming convention used by every other page\nobject (LoginPage, SignupPage, SelectTeamPage, etc.); the ''Should'' prefix\nwas an outlier with no functional meaning.\n\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>\n\n* set default IntuneSettings\n\n* fix session attributes specs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: yasser khan <attitude3cena.yf@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: saturnino <saturnino@mattermost.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqudSZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOWkQALG+B4YGO1h6dNgVbWoXcy1x\nHujcWKzpqs2zPpkoxiqey92hhWneWIYWahc9rJUBPAMkDa2E0w4zAaiA0Fi0EcMf\nJOVISJ/KML12rMmOsRUyXdXUI/OI1/vCU8Cq6dCQX3l/db82pI7P+QVolZSHkPjv\niDDKMURi0pLdgZfitrMfssadQXet3US0L2xSGVzv8YaIbfKFA+e0vrwIFc1zHqJZ\nfiQDmuo7WybdGEH6J8dCoRzCNa7OC3/eYSIHzUJ86/ssnUIqfX059DiEW1jIb/s4\nLkxGne8uITkxRlc8MOaVj93ZTVPCO6E4YJgqW2kzrk4qWKHLoSsYLBc7cTKfEY7c\nN8kG7vrkWxgPTWeV2yRTYnYZ4G8G0ho7iwkgdo2aVa3QbBUczu2kbF1aIDyhR4Cp\nYv3C4lpEeJPMPdtvGtrmtS8zipavnOws5szyRvpiOUUE+7taRUUp16FS4ac+2Xwf\npx4hBY+ZnIgQrRlGBHiMkfnlIQqhp3yqWoFpdrYnC90zSNVsg7RXCT5wzYhwFIx2\nIR5nhAJjJNIeJCOc7P5eML+yu9oVM9suYXBJit7iN1fIFUAN9w7ZwMf5FZa3QKAw\nUBCLbbZtOe2J7M/SPA3DW3DMTFwQDjVUs2hXotkxAFlUEN38Qf8UrlV5949pVrG5\nQnOrDm1P4nmmPHABaymw\n=gk2l\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T02:44:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-f