.com/users/matthewbirtch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthewbirtch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/commits/1f33d75c0c2f9d26cd9be109ae66b24c0bc3f28b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:33:37Z","email":"mattbirtch@gmail.com","name":"Matthew Birtch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T16:33:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"System console LHS UI update (#26966)\n\n* update lhs styles\n\n* updated categories style\n\n* tweaks to admin sidebar styles\n\n* updated letter spacing on categories\n\n* tweaked lhs\n\n* add hover state to filter control\n\n* tweaks to sidebar styles\n\n* reverted change top padding on admin console wrapper\n\n* tweaks to lhs\n\n* update width\n\n* tweaks to colors\n\n* tweaks to LHS\n\n* tweaks to category padding\n\n* tweaks to lhs colors\n\n* fix lint issues, update snapshot\n\n* Polish system console LHS: section dividers and avatar sizing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Migrate system console header menu to new Menu with Switch teams submenu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix system console header menu keyboard focus after open.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove unused admin team-switch i18n strings from en.json.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Update e2e selectors for new system console header menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Polish system console LHS nav: inset chip rows and clearer active state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix admin console single-team switch link and refine LHS header spacing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix Stylelint property order in admin console filter styles.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Add active left border to admin console sidebar nav items.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove redundant Switch teams menu item for single-team users.\n\nSingle-team admins return to their team via BackstageNavbar instead of\nthe header menu. Simplify AdminNavbarDropdown and expand unit tests for\nlogout, external links, and multi-team submenu behavior.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Update system console e2e tests for single-team navigation.\n\nUse BackstageNavbar to return to team when Switch teams is absent from\nthe header menu, and scope Cypress menu helpers to the named admin menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Clean up admin console sidebar styling and layout tokens.\n\nAlign settings nav focus with shared patterns, extract sidebar width and\nnav offset CSS variables, remove unused tokens, and add focus-visible\nstyling to the header menu trigger.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix lint issues in admin navbar dropdown\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix import order in admin navbar dropdown test\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Stylelint property order in admin sidebar active state\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Wait for menu close before asserting dropdown actions in tests\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Ensure single-team setup for MM-T909 system console menu test\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix admin navbar dropdown tests for deferred menu onClick\n\nUse WithTestMenuContext instead of Menu.Container so menu close\ncallbacks fire synchronously in Jest. Assert modal dialogType against\nthe connected modal components rather than expect.any(Function).\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Restore Team Selection label for zero-team admin menu\n\nUse admin.nav.switch when the user belongs to no teams, matching\npre-migration copy. Keep Switch teams for the multi-team submenu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Simplify admin navbar dropdown test menu wrapper\n\nUse WithTestMenuContext directly, matching other menu item unit tests,\ninstead of wrapping with MuiMenuList and CompassDesignProvider.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Remove unused clearfix from admin sidebar header\n\nThe flex-based header already handles overflow on child elements; the\nlegacy clearfix mixin only applied overflow: hidden.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Remove dead admin console sidebar styling and sectionClass\n\nDrop unused sections--settings CSS, misplaced admin-console__header\nAvatar rules, and the orphaned sass:color import. Remove the unused\nsectionClass prop and rely on Avatar-lg for sidebar header sizing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Align admin header menu positioning with Menu.Container props\n\nUse transformOrigin horizontal offset like other LHS menus instead of\nMuiPopover :has() CSS. Set main menu width via menu.width and scope\nSwitch teams submenu min-width to its MenuList id.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Rename admin sidebar header team__name to header__title\n\nThe primary header line shows System Console, not a team name.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Use flex layout for admin sidebar nav scroll area\n\nGive the Scrollbars wrapper flex: 1 instead of a fixed height calc on\nnav-pills__container. Size the console grid main row with minmax(0, 1fr)\nand remove the unused --admin-sidebar-nav-offset token.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Use lowercase hex for sys-sidebar-bg token\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Revert unrelated MenuIcon changes from system console PR\n\nThe admin sidebar header uses ChevronDownIcon from compass-icons; the\nshared MenuIcon widget is still used by mobile channel header buttons.\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Fix Stylelint property order in admin sidebar scroll rule\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com>\n\n* Improve admin console team submenu truncation and scrollbar hover.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix Stylelint property order on submenu paper styles.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove obsolete team-switch i18n keys from non-English locales.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Revert \"Remove obsolete team-switch i18n keys from non-English locales.\"\n\nThis reverts commit be37f063dfb2946d0ceb5c700e25780176c6f155.\n\n* Restore unused team-switch strings in en.json to satisfy i18n CI.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Keep en.json team-switch key restore minimal without resorting the file.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Sync en.json with i18n-extract after removing unused team-switch strings.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Close admin header menu before clicking BackstageNavbar in e2e.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Remove obsolete team-switch i18n keys from non-English locales.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* retain clip, menu portals so no longer gets clipped within anyway\n\n* Fix Stylelint property order: move overflow before flex-direction in .admin-sidebar\n\n* Fix e2e sidebar header menu button locator after portal-based menu migration\n\nThe #admin-sidebar-header ID is on the button element itself; scoping\ngetByRole(''button'') inside it searched for a button within a button.\nUse container directly since it resolves to the button. Also remove the\nstale comment describing the overflow-x/y split (no longer applicable\nsince portals render the menu outside the sidebar''s clip region).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix hover on active state\n\n* padding tweak on nav items to tighten a bit\n\n* Rename the System Console header menu accessible name to match the visible label.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Restore native external links in the System Console header menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Add Menu.ItemExternalLink and use it for System Console header links.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix keyboard focus and Enter/Space on System Console header menu links.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Point the System Console header menu overflow spec at the Switch teams submenu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Tighten System Console LHS letter-spacing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Matthew Birtch <2040554+matthewbirtch@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8229224d1a599c7a505604d960a9af8523e69207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/trees/8229224d1a599c7a505604d960a9af8523e69207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mattermost/mattermost/git/commits/1f33d75c0c2f9d26cd9be109ae66b24c0bc3f28b","verification":{"payload":"tree 8229224d1a599c7a505604d960a9af8523e69207\nparent 3a1f5f0da1868dd2d67a7b8d91ffd6333357354f\nauthor Matthew Birtch <mattbirtch@gmail.com> 1790440417 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790440417 -0400\n\nSystem console LHS UI update (#26966)\n\n* update lhs styles\n\n* updated categories style\n\n* tweaks to admin sidebar styles\n\n* updated letter spacing on categories\n\n* tweaked lhs\n\n* add hover state to filter control\n\n* tweaks to sidebar styles\n\n* reverted change top padding on admin console wrapper\n\n* tweaks to lhs\n\n* upda