omments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickJS/awesome-angular/commits/055b6caf16bb693306d55c0a5bdc146a97d7f1ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:01:40Z","email":"seifertluk11@gmail.com","name":"kasual1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:01:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add kritzel to the list of editors in README (#2573)\n\n* Add kritzel to the list of editors in README\n\nHey there,\r\n\r\nKritzel is an infinite canvas library that comes with first class support for Angular.\r\n\r\nI build it over the last 2.5 years and it is not an experiment but rather a close to production editor that is easy to integrate when you need DOM based infinite canvas capabilities in your application.\r\n\r\nSorry if i got this wrong and this is not the right place to submit it, nonetheless I am extremely proud to what this has turned into.\r\n\r\nMany greetings and thanks for maintaining this list!\n\n* docs:  add period to kritzel desc\n\n* docs: add hyphen to first class\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: J. Degand <70610011+jdegand@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef3675d52cd56f1be75a695397360e1e984f88f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickJS/awesome-angular/git/trees/ef3675d52cd56f1be75a695397360e1e984f88f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PatrickJS/awesome-angular/git/commits/055b6caf16bb693306d55c0a5bdc146a97d7f1ea","verification":{"payload":"tree ef3675d52cd56f1be75a695397360e1e984f88f0\nparent ecd6ef9c5324c38d24f7145346c5a717a0f9903c\nauthor kasual1 <seifertluk11@gmail.com> 1790960500 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790960500 -0400\n\nAdd kritzel to the list of editors in README (#2573)\n\n* Add kritzel to the list of editors in README\n\nHey there,\r\n\r\nKritzel is an infinite canvas library that comes with first class support for Angular.\r\n\r\nI build it over the last 2.5 years and it is not an experiment but rather a close to production editor that is easy to integrate when you need DOM based infinite canvas capabilities in your application.\r\n\r\nSorry if i got this wrong and this is not the right place to submit it, nonetheless I am extremely proud to what this has turned into.\r\n\r\nMany greetings and thanks for maintaining this list!\n\n* docs:  add period to kritzel desc\n\n* docs: add hyphen to first class\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: J. Degand <70610011+jdegand@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv+N0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARHcQAF0Dldb+gUoPXUYBW4VFypCR\nW92MKICIpvtjM+g0WROgbwhECtU5Q1xf6bd8ZuQxp+dSn96Li05kBeY6MTIP8sR7\nOTJU7W9D7jr5KGUL1KcdanHU+/8Z3qJDjpU4FP3u6CDtjuGXDX+0ru57OtiRKsEj\nqNV0AhQptPDR1aQ6WXlfWWmcMs+3zeIHQPwWFsc2/DmTnyY+Y0Y5VJalWVLEg76V\n+DyaSkzv/q5pYuXNepVwmXu/ClFBprW+UzYYGAbuokW6+z6vRe7euAfxc3R+/VrG\nPJPC1YC/d37birPDduyCaaXZYcuCUZPtsOaVzwejNpsHq8J2Q6e80bJ87dCwdvYk\n8x6XT45aoRNByJ0mODk4aSul+rzw9M9bFMv37n4/a71jxGoPT62YDa2y98eg5z6c\n+ztyp+CFL56alev6guRLjYFhNkMNZfevaumyvNeqpbcHHaRWwnpzPG3HXub1eb7W\no/mTVYHS/0LINVyJfFbAjaHR3Gb93xGd9xkTOpS1A/QH+hzhCv4buEQ6WedvDoKj\nFngZ8Ou7aEHSJ1V/9L6zrV76eQKTW2VB/GeESaXGH5T5aGdcdbqy2AcQwrnz0+zf\nAuf8PrUVHOx2V00emhKMfNvmGeIYEW+2imhg4TuoLofmFnAYo1AjJr4zA2sfevcQ\nQJmsnrgi8bxjDTuXgU6C\n=k0PS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T17:01:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https: