ue together with their type, so tracking\nthe panels by name could produce duplicate keys. Tracking by reference\nmatches the previous *ngFor behavior. Also drops a redundant optional\nchain in the settings template''s @else if branch.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: William Newman <3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6be33265c55e1e5666a499b7ff77b248b180ad13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/trees/6be33265c55e1e5666a499b7ff77b248b180ad13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/commits/f83905790c5b95adb464a1d8581c1e112ae1121f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6be33265c55e1e5666a499b7ff77b248b180ad13\nparent da9e883c1c824fa6940add2016d7f401b2160229\nauthor Kristoffer <82471248+ktsorensenWX@users.noreply.github.com> 1791051863 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791051863 -0600\n\nfix(web-app, admin): Modernizing Angular 21+ Admin Authentication tab (#530)\n\n* fix(web-app, admin): Modernizing Angular 21+ Admin Authentication tab\n\n* fix(web-app, admin): Track authentication strategies by reference\n\nStrategy names are only unique together with their type, so tracking\nthe panels by name could produce duplicate keys. Tracking by reference\nmatches the previous *ngFor behavior. Also drops a redundant optional\nchain in the settings template''s @else if branch.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: William Newman <3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwUhXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv7AQAGcihFKnpKDih26S4U6OAxhh\nb3S7g96B5CYxemd/z3RmtI/NxfcD4W13FgGZwCv5acj8e2QmMR7AyB6DjJ6xVn6R\nB+tszI5YNtAlSvUo64HMkbmsVy3zWQexT4zDw3F5AQ4myYhNCSPjGpJl6Ww7jJXz\ncu4xgB6DTLzXaggSGZEWXyNgpLb8Ljsq8ruCRE6pd6P4EaLnUUQin8DrptOl/tMA\nSj5kamqEEJNspN+H4UIHF2LniG270oKO9WLR0ptjtb4xQebQUo3FJVrCp2fOfYBf\nIJ/fWPJ1A0Mo5GJfm+GRq2IPAI1u69oPOVUz8WoBO8xaeXp4nYdMLXjrMqGWCCWY\nilVlEF81MH7EjoFaZ3g7omzTjjABXbrGO2W2xp+zU1JP51jAgDloCBfo0iRcIjMR\nvtm1KhZGp8Wbs6ZosYC/q