ageoint/mage-server/commits/ec4cfb194f790ad491ad4f92416bb73bc237899f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3382274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/newmanw","id":3382274,"login":"newmanw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODIyNzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/commits/306a7d1ccb08439be1846c3769778fd9e6e0bef6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:27:39Z","email":"3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Billy Newman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:27:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: observation search and filtering, and user location filtering (#518)\n\n* Add observation search and filtering, and user location filtering\n\nAdds a search bar to the observation list and filter dialogs for observations\nand user locations. Observations can be filtered by keyword, time range, team\nor member, attachments, favorites, important, and per-field conditions. People\ncan be filtered by time range and team or member. Both lists show their active\nfilters, result count and paging, and recover from failed searches with a\nretry. The filters also apply to the map, and the export page reuses the\nkeyword and condition filters.\n\nClient\n- New observation filter dialog, user location filter dialog and search bar,\n  replacing the old filter component. They are standalone, use control flow\n  and signals with OnPush, and follow Material 3.\n- EventService and FilterService drive the map, list page and locations from\n  triggers with per-fetch teardown, so switching events or destroying the\n  service drops late responses instead of applying them.\n- The member filter takes an event id, teams and an initial filter, owns its\n  chips after init and clears them when the event changes.\n- Flagging as important and favoriting update the list immediately instead of\n  waiting for the next poll.\n- A new export starts from the current observation and location filters,\n  including attachments, favorites, important, keyword and condition.\n- The observation, people, feed and export panels share the same backgrounds,\n  toolbar colors, and empty state icons and text. The export detail toolbar\n  holds the download and delete actions.\n- Type the map layers, user locations and observation entities shared by these\n  components, and remove the unused follow inputs on the people list.\n\nServer\n- Exports keep both the keyword and the condition when both are sent, and drop\n  the filter when neither is.\n- Favorite and important updates populate the same user fields as the read\n  path, so responses match what the list expects.\n- Document the known team-scoping gap in resolveUserIsAnyOf.\n\nTests\n- New specs for the dialogs, search bar, date/time picker, field filter and\n  observation page updates, plus expanded specs for the map, filter and event\n  services, local storage, sidebar, navigation, user list and export create.\n- web-app 1465 passing, service 1235 passing (55 pending).\n\n* Fix member filter error handling and event getMembers access check\n\nThe member filter''s search and saved-filter pre-population had no error\nhandling, so a failed request could corrupt the dialog''s rendering.\n\ngetMembers checked a nonexistent Event field, so team-only members (most\nusers) got 404 from /api/events/:id/members. getNonMembers is untouched,\nsince it should stay admin-only.","tree":{"sha":"b96d9fe6e12829944e613808da6c11f39d444167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/trees/b96d9fe6e12829944e613808da6c11f39d444167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/commits/306a7d1ccb08439be1846c3769778fd9e6e0bef6","verification":{"payload":"tree b96d9fe6e12829944e613808da6c11f39d444167\nparent bf7fd7fc2d55b436438b556af35244f8c3350cf9\nauthor Billy Newman <3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com> 1790778459 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790778459 -0600\n\nfeat: observation search and filtering, and user location filtering (#518)\n\n* Add observation search and filtering, and user location filtering\n\nAdds a search bar to the observation list and filter dialogs for observations\nand user locations. Observations can be filtered by keyword, time range, team\nor member, attachments, favorites, important, and per-field conditions. People\ncan be filtered by time range and team or member. Both lists show their active\nfilters, result count and paging, and recover from failed searches with a\nretry. The filters also apply to the map, and the export page reuses the\nkeyword and condition filters.\n\nClient\n- New observation filter dialog, user location filter dialog and search bar,\n  replacing the old filter component. They are standalone, use control flow\n  and signals with OnPush, and follow Material 3.\n- EventService and FilterService drive the map, list page and locations from\n  triggers with per-fetch teardown, so switching events or destroying the\n  service drops late responses instead of applying them.\n- The member filter takes an event id, teams and an initial filter, owns its\n  chips after init and clears them when the event changes.\n- Flagging as important and favoriting update the list immediately instead of\n  waiting for the next poll.\n- A new export starts from the current observation and location filters,\n  including attachments, favorites, important, keyword and condition.\n- The observation, people, feed and export panels share the same backgrounds,\n  toolbar colors, and empty state icons and text. The export detail toolbar\n  holds the download and delete actions.\n- Type the map layers, user locations and observation entities shared by these\n  components, and remove the unused follow inputs on the people list.\n\nServer\n- Exports keep both the keyword and the condition when both are sent, and drop\n  the filter when neither is.\n- Favorite and important updates populate the same user fields as the read\n  path, so responses match what the list expects.\n- Document the known team-scoping gap in resolveUserIsAnyOf.\n\nTests\n- New specs for the dialogs, search bar, date/time picker, field filter and\n  observation page updates, plus expanded specs for the map, filter and event\n  services, local storage, sidebar, navigation, user list and export create.\n- web-app 1465 passing, service 1235 passing (55 pending).\n\n* Fix member filter error handling and event getMembers access check\n\nThe member filter''s search and saved-filter pre-population had no error\nhandling, so a failed request could corrupt the dialog''s rendering.\n\ngetMembers checked a nonexistent Event field, so team-only members (most\nusers) got 404 from /api/events/:id/members. getNonMembers is untouched,\nsince it should stay admin-only.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvRxbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4/AQABrDmv9y2rvUlTiM1obXTaSR\ncZSmIh1GqgB97Plo3c14h4Yoxd7FF43ODDSRphFU/j8Da3w1v7lCd9evfsSfFNi0\neJf3ilSDtHXc6jF2ETOEPcflCJelNiZ9NeZvgtELg1PBxg7s53ISeH8/MGk3Urz3\nF3UhYUJoGllEFnlu+2CyKJV1+EDPxlz+XKNDcua2pGDl/8w4ZjlyD65rQEUIgM04\nvU+E5bJukBcu8Jlj/8Rv0I7VjNVpWLwR0jLGYGnBX7LRl5oydSR6mMrZahh95BCk\nOAtFP4yDiiowL/ZAGJIwkQxspFRbCBXSXM