jclark118/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jclark118","id":15463724,"login":"jclark118","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDYzNzI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jclark118","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/commits/57e1bbe25059c09254ee80007a0110b2c44e3310/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:54:37Z","email":"jclark118@gmail.com","name":"Joe Clark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:54:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: arcgis plugin updates (#492)\n\n* support for standalone or portal validation\n\n* UI fixes for icons, screen width for feature server modal\n\n* fix dupe env declaration\n\n* fix duplicate observations for new vs updated, remove last edited date\n\n* fix attachments\n\n* Add ArcGIS symbology rendering and fix icon fallback for formless observations, fix add/delete/update concurrency issues\n\n* Fix ArcGIS form field naming mismatch and add WKT encoding for geometry fields\n\n* don''t let plugin init block server listen\n\n* improved error handling for queries\n\n* Fix ArcGIS feature service UI bugs, cache eviction on auth failure, and layer-event scoping\n\n* implement latest logging structural updates, enabled field update\n\n* fix logger mapping\n\n* allow discovery of feature servers, oauth, show which are editable, handle event synching and server selection better\n\n* handle multiple layer selection\n\n* better error handling, default event synching resets, improved permission handling/display\n\n* ui improvements, better event handling, improve descriptions\n\n* perform user priv check during authentication to provide write warnings\n\n* fix events being stuck after initial load\n\n* observation push status table, fixes for event config on init\n\n* observation sent status indication and count\n\n* observation field hover menu to show details\n\n* improve handling multiple events, push status, auth warnings, fix inserting fields on disabled events\n\n* try to resolve portal endpoints automatically\n\n* disable browsing until fields are filled\n\n* enforce form fields\n\n* adding tests, restructure\n\n* encrypt stored identitymanager for saving configs\n\n* rollback mongoose for now\n\n* test sending batch observations\n\n* warnings for expired credentials\n\n* portal result set reduction\n\n* package update fix\n\n* package-lock update\n\n* test fix\n\n* fix npm ci testing for local mage.service reference\n\n* fix npm ci testing for local mage.service reference\n\n* attribute mapping fixes, force arcgis formatting compliance\n\n* prevent attribute overwrites, deault browsing selection, default observation id\n\n* search indicator\n\n* event page ui/ux updates\n\n* refactor event selection menu, get rid of popup and use expansions instead\n\n* allow user to reset entire arcgis config\n\n* style fix\n\n* more uniform button design\n\n* show attachment status for each observation, plugin version update\n\n* add changelog\n\n* udpate readme\n\n* improved messaging when it can''t connect to a server\n\n* feature server url suggestions history\n\n* portal url history\n\n* fix: package-lock after develop merge\n\n* fix: add missing mat autocomplete import in test\n\n* fix(arcgis.service): unnecessary async qualifiers\n\n* chore(arcgis.web-app): remove console logs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Robert St. John <1292665+restjohn@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f0e8df613c876041402422d3f481935c304c057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/trees/