n\n* adding tests, restructure\n\n* encrypt stored identitymanager for saving configs\n\n* rollback mongoose for now\n\n* test sending batch observations\n\n* warnings for expired credentials\n\n* portal result set reduction\n\n* package update fix\n\n* package-lock update\n\n* test fix\n\n* fix npm ci testing for local mage.service reference\n\n* fix npm ci testing for local mage.service reference\n\n* attribute mapping fixes, force arcgis formatting compliance\n\n* prevent attribute overwrites, deault browsing selection, default observation id\n\n* search indicator\n\n* event page ui/ux updates\n\n* refactor event selection menu, get rid of popup and use expansions instead\n\n* allow user to reset entire arcgis config\n\n* style fix\n\n* more uniform button design\n\n* show attachment status for each observation, plugin version update\n\n* add changelog\n\n* udpate readme\n\n* improved messaging when it can''t connect to a server\n\n* feature server url suggestions history\n\n* portal url history\n\n* fix: package-lock after develop merge\n\n* fix: add missing mat autocomplete import in test\n\n* fix(arcgis.service): unnecessary async qualifiers\n\n* chore(arcgis.web-app): remove console logs\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Robert St. John <1292665+restjohn@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqriOdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQTgQAIv5rCuDCQflp6QDkpgjF15L\ngysWbcsPg9s1c9IpomM7DrgDTTiS7haCmZDA3GtBMiriBN4o0E6keD9LwYO1KLvc\nUSzaX3uXl/ra6+QzS1/8O4eQcRC8iuCZjStqHMhRtk4zyoAOFTtmiBdbmrETRXB7\nZ1JmpWEhge3gUPH2B+oVQlHu7OFb5pnnp3IYzlQQBlIotapSehpAcx61JttsrIRT\nZlmXd+dg3MHwREbWj9S6shur6G/TrfCWjC9RT2wG6h6++i3c9doVs66U92dGAd4F\nqcxyEGrteZNUrMZt/hKS+MHKxCEwbK1XIGF545zu5SU65R4ycDqdqYv4jSmDu/f2\nm+jns1zWurWk+5LDBvOi9nnWDupjoLItN6vabnIXC4LX7SX4tR7SJ90WMp744iBQ\nz5JyWL7MWobxw+Po5Xzb2aMbIVH9isN2p7/250pP2s1atEQBQEq7HmZq0FGchOk4\nMb8Ai0LHq9ZOUOxzeyX0pCiBqvSkD91IOrMPQ7g4sf2GTLEqatSQj+OkU7nWG2C/\n00eIwIh3E6HujK9zE5mPqvS4zEOgxx3AiFgh