YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ngageoint/mage-server/commit/6539a8790680ce47562d6812ddb45b2bc12f73e0","sha":"6539a8790680ce47562d6812ddb45b2bc12f73e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/commits/6539a8790680ce47562d6812ddb45b2bc12f73e0"}],"sha":"f30f56c5e5ae973c4c799fabbe99a42ae706b3b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/commits/f30f56c5e5ae973c4c799fabbe99a42ae706b3b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3382274?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/newmanw","id":3382274,"login":"newmanw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODIyNzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/newmanw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/commits/876b76efca6ef70c0d4ec7077e40f9f97d5ca839/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:12:08Z","email":"3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Billy Newman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:12:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(web-app): move event selection to the navbar (#494)\n\nAdds a searchable event picker to the top navbar (CDK menu dropdown),\nreplacing the old flow where the event was one of several fields in\nthe \"Filter\" dialog. The dialog now only handles team/user/form/time\nfiltering.\n\nTo support this without a page-wide refresh, FilterService moves from\na listener/callback pattern (addListener/onFilterChanged) to RxJS\nBehaviorSubjects (event$, teams$, users$, forms$, interval$,\nactionFilter$) - same filtering logic and state, just a reactive\nnotification mechanism instead of callbacks. EventService,\nNavigationComponent, HomeComponent, UserListComponent, and\nObservationListComponent all subscribe to these instead of\nregistering as listeners; EventService''s event/interval/team/user/form\nreaction logic is otherwise unchanged (still client-side filtering,\nstill the same incremental add/remove bookkeeping).\n\nComponents with a real Angular lifecycle use takeUntilDestroyed()\ninstead of a manual destroy$ Subject. EventService keeps a manual\ndestroy$, since it''s a root-singleton service with its own init()/\ndestroy() lifecycle that isn''t tied to Angular''s actual injector\ndestruction.\n\nAlso extracts a shared filterAutocomplete() helper in FilterComponent\nfor the team/user/form autocomplete pickers, which had the same\nnarrow-by-selection-and-search-text logic duplicated three times.\n\nAdds test coverage for the new reactive wiring: filter.service.spec.ts,\nevent.service.spec.ts, and navigation.component.spec.ts.","tree":{"sha":"f1bdf9c4b7ce6a5aa7750bd05e3d0338820e1f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/trees/f1bdf9c4b7ce6a5aa7750bd05e3d0338820e1f69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngageoint/mage-server/git/commits/876b76efca6ef70c0d4ec7077e40f9f97d5ca839","verification":{"payload":"tree f1bdf9c4b7ce6a5aa7750bd05e3d0338820e1f69\nparent 880af728ca6aecacc6589c4854226a920cd239de\nauthor Billy Newman <3382274+newmanw@users.noreply.github.com> 1788293528 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788293528 -0600\n\nfeat(web-app): move event selection to the navbar (#494)\n\nAdds a searchable event picker to the top navbar (CDK menu dropdown),\nreplacing the old flow where the event was one of several fields in\nthe \"Filter\" dialog. The dialog now only handles team/user/form/time\nfiltering.\n\nTo support this without a page-wide refresh, FilterService moves from\na listener/callback pattern (addListener/onFilterChanged) to RxJS\nBehaviorSubjects (event$, teams$, users$, forms$, interval$,\nactionFilter$) - same filtering logic and state, just a reactive\nnotification mechanism instead of callbacks. EventService,\nNavigationComponent, HomeComponent, UserListComponent, and\nObservationListComponent all subscribe to these instead of\nregistering as listeners; EventService''s event/interval/team/user/form\nreaction logic is otherwise unchanged (still client-side filtering,\nstill the same incremental add/remove bookkeeping).\n\nComponents with a real Angular lifecycle use takeUntilDestroyed()\ninstead of a manual destroy$ Subject. EventService keeps a manual\ndestroy$, since it''s a root-singleton service with its own init()/\ndestroy() lifecycle that isn''t tied to Angular''s actual injector\ndestruction.\n\nAlso extracts a shared filterAutocomplete() helper in FilterComponent\nfor the team/user/form autocomplete pickers, which had the same\nnarrow-by-selection-and-search-text logic duplicated three times.\n\nAdds test coverage for the new reactive wiring: filter.service.spec.ts,\nevent.service.spec.ts, and navigation.component.spec.ts.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlzGYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhokQABeilHfVUFZkqEbjHKWHMMBH\n3mNdZbDH8UqT4OkEtrWFza3akfo7Y4+kyRYG+IHrPTaGEY5mCxql9JRff7oF//Bt\n6pq/MBNNkpF6B43dw6LPCm2Mo+62cBdyReY+lCkBn9ED6ICAGRtIQR3+JtztwsEc\nUkRro2VPXWvxMS2y1yP6VHqUw4e+05Uaj9BHvtoxqGcJSEeWudJ/Zc8hSt8ZrFxz\nksyfg3HLHpg4APORlKLgcMjCdg8gToNoOZSDJ5ZEh3yXtEV6CaD0NTwbY4ss5ysp\nf25j9jmGIeQ93sfl9R7lUGlvm7AYrvvYIavbFS96xmfzu/7D5pIPs/aBHmGNEF9T\nppsJ712gsr57HX2Viz0ptQ/vmLk3/f3wVG/Cjt2NHPNCHShcRWc1GXHHP5Dd1sf2\nwdhSH75epZPmYwin/yh7Jn6ee6Dy0mIsAZvfEy06jHVPsAKdAMB9nAajVVAeDaEb\nTbb4Ulk8BICRH2NtdVTAMDAQ3Cp4W