00","sha":"8abdfc0d4de9213c63ae01221ea6e82435cba400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/8abdfc0d4de9213c63ae01221ea6e82435cba400"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/c1970bb6eb3d48b164e7ca4b71f456a066817a35","sha":"c1970bb6eb3d48b164e7ca4b71f456a066817a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/c1970bb6eb3d48b164e7ca4b71f456a066817a35"}],"sha":"d4952ef24fdd2811707a5ca10394c3bcac7d11f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/d4952ef24fdd2811707a5ca10394c3bcac7d11f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/c1970bb6eb3d48b164e7ca4b71f456a066817a35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:23:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:23:56Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Require @iobroker/aggregate 1.0.3 for the counter NULL fix\n\nFlushing the buffer on stop also persists the NULL boundary marker that\nwriteNulls writes on unload. getCounterDiff''s \"last row before the\nwindow\" subquery has no `val IS NOT NULL` filter, so that marker is the\nfirst entry getCounter sees - and aggregate 1.0.2 reads it as the number\n0, interpolating the value at the window start between 0 and the first\nreal reading instead of using the reading itself.\n\nThat is why adapter-tests-mysql failed on this branch while master is\ngreen: on master the marker never reached the database. testMySQLExisting\nasked for 200 and got 200.3171411627029, which is exactly 0 interpolated\nacross the 314 s between the previous test file''s unload marker and this\nwindow:\n\n    (200 - 100 * 314317/315317) + (110 - 10) = 200.31714...\n\naggregate 1.0.3 drops null entries before computing the counter.\ntestCommons.js now covers the case, so the version floor is pinned by a\nunit test rather than only by the MySQL job.\n\nThe lockfile is edited surgically - a plain `npm install` here also drops\nthe optional `pg` entry and every `\"peer\": true` flag, which would break\nthe Postgres job.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"073d2f91a78a6b803f0db0638a31239c4a33dfdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/073d2f91a78a6b803f0db0638a31239c4a33dfdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/c1970bb6eb3d48b164e7ca4b71f456a066817a35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm