verified_at":"2026-10-03T11:35:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/8abdfc0d4de9213c63ae01221ea6e82435cba400","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKDhhYmRmYzBkNGRlOTIxM2M2M2FlMDEyMjFlYTZlODI0MzVjYmE0MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","sha":"eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556","sha":"1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556"}],"sha":"8abdfc0d4de9213c63ae01221ea6e82435cba400","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/8abdfc0d4de9213c63ae01221ea6e82435cba400"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:21:29Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:21:29Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Send a usable payload from the Test connection button (#355)\n\n\"Test connection\" reported a failure while the adapter was happily writing to\nthe same database. The error read \"invalid config\", which sent people looking\nat settings that were fine.\n\nIt is not a database error at all. The adapter sends that string from exactly\none place: when `msg.message.config` is missing, i.e. when the request arrives\nwith no settings. The database is never contacted.\n\nThe payload came from a text template that is substituted and then JSON.parsed\nby the admin, which logs a parse failure to the browser console and sends the\nmessage with `null`. So anything that made the template produce invalid JSON\nturned into \"invalid config\" with no visible explanation. `encrypt` and\n`rejectUnauthorized` were interpolated without quotes, so an unset checkbox\nproduced `\"encrypt\": undefined`; a value containing a newline broke it too -\nthe admin escapes quotes and backslashes, but not control characters.\n\nEvery value now goes through JSON.stringify, which quotes and escapes it and\nturns a missing one into a usable literal. Verified against the previously\nbreaking inputs: unset checkboxes, quotes, backslashes, newlines and a\ncompletely empty configuration all produce valid JSON now.\n\nThe template also left out three settings that testConnection() reads:\n\n- `doNotCreateDatabase`, which meant the PostgreSQL branch always tested the\n  maintenance database `postgres`. That is the defect behind #285, and #562\n  fixed it in the adapter without the button ever sending the flag, so the fix\n  could not take effect.\n- `dbname`, so the fallback would have used \"iobroker\" rather than the\n  configured name.\n- `dockerMysql`, so a containerised instance was tested against whatever stale\n  host and credentials the fields still held instead of the container''s.\n\nAnd the message itself now says what happened rather than blaming the\nconfiguration, translated into all ten languages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2b5871b960868aaced4a1566639c538156a7d69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/c2b5871b960868aaced4a1566639c538156a7d69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKDE5NTgxNDZlMDBkZTUwOGRmZDUzNjBiYTVhYmU3NWFmZWE4YzM1NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","sha":"eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea"}],"sha":"1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/1958146e00de508dfd5360ba5abe75afea8c3556"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/cf901006226e213384449d53797ec037cbfb201c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:59:50Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:59:50Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Do not flush a buffer that does not exist\n\nThe unconditional flush crashed the adapter on stop with\n\"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ''length'')\" in\npushValuesIntoDB, which takes `list.length` on its first line.\n\nNot every entry in sqlDPs is a configured datapoint. Four places create a stub\nwith `this.sqlDPs[id] ||= {} as SQLPointConfig` - storeState, getHistory and the\nobject view do it just to carry an index - and those have no `list` at all. The\nprevious flushes never reached them because both sat behind `skipped` or\n`config`, which only a real datapoint has; making the flush unconditional\nexposed them.\n\nflushBuffer() now checks the buffer before using it and reports the datapoint\ndone when there is nothing to write.\n\nCaught by the MySQL CI job, which runs five test files in sequence and so stops\nthe adapter five times with stubs present. The single-file SQLite run did not\nreach the case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdae69cff6b41e699d39d3ec2bad977860a016d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/cdae69cff6b41e699d39d3ec2bad977860a016d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/cf901006226e213384449d53797ec037cbfb201c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/cf901006226e213384449d53797ec037cbfb201c","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKGNmOTAxMDA2MjI2ZTIxMzM4NDQ0OWQ1Mzc5N2VjMDM3Y2JmYjIwMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875","sha":"0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875"}],"sha":"cf901006226e213384449d53797ec037cbfb201c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/cf901006226e213384449d53797ec037cbfb201c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:12:20Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:12:20Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Always flush the buffer on stop, and let unload finish (#577)\n\nfinish() was supposed to write everything still held in RAM when the adapter\nstops. Three things kept it from doing so, all of them only visible when\nmaxLength is greater than 0.\n\nThe buffered values were written only from inside the `skipped` and the\n`writeNulls` branch - there was no unconditional flush anywhere. A datapoint\nwith neither simply lost its buffer. That is not an exotic case: writeNulls is\nforced off for every dialect with multiRequests === false, which is SQLite, so\nit hit every SQLite instance, plus anyone who unticked \"Write NULL values on\nstart/stop boundaries\".\n\nThe counter was shared by all datapoints. Each one incremented it and the flush\nran on whichever callback brought it back to zero, using that callback''s id, so\nat most one datapoint''s buffer was ever written even with writeNulls on. The\nsame counter let allFinished() close the pool while later datapoints were still\nbeing dispatched - the dispatch is deliberately spread over seconds\n(`delay += dpcount % 50 === 0 ? 1000 : 0`), which makes that more likely rather\nthan less.\n\nAnd allFinished() was reachable only through that one flush callback. With\nnothing to write, the counter never moved, the unload callback never fired and\njs-controller had to kill the instance. There was a guard for zero datapoints\nbut none for \"datapoints exist and none scheduled work\".\n\nfinishId() now counts its own pending writes, flushes the buffer unconditionally\nonce they are done, and reports the datapoint complete. finish() counts\ndatapoints rather than writes and only lets the last one end the run, after the\ndispatch loop has set allDispatched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00d9a55539f9a7c23b39f3cb4dc1fc3f2c65a755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/00d9a55539f9a7c23b39f3cb4dc1fc3f2c65a755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKDAwMjg0MzY3MzNlZTYxMmRmMThhMzZhZjQ5ZTA2OTNlODgyODQ4NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","sha":"eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea"}],"sha":"0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/0028436733ee612df18a36af49e0693e88284875"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:29:55Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"Bluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T06:29:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #575 from ioBroker/fix/alias-changes-only\n\nDetect changes by value, not by the controller''s lc (#295)","tree":{"sha":"95951b6ec3e969f5166a9f93f9d3ff10bfe5e86f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/95951b6ec3e969f5166a9f93f9d3ff10bfe5e86f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/eed728712c07a4469e65337873790b39df4f46ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 95951b6ec3e969f5166a9f93f9d3ff10bfe5e86f\nparent 2797d0503022663007ab309f02a19561a29ddf84\nparent 25b9a8633d9015edbdb84b6d15e25bcbc6ed7d56\nauthor Bluefox <dogafox@gmail.com> 1791008995 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791008995 +0300\n\nMerge pull request #575 from ioBroker/fix/alias-changes-only\n\nDetect changes by value, not by the controller''s lc (#295)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwKDjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYp8QADqqRbLoHdVlF7OwBHu00LBn\nSDTLleq7epdpjLwm7qQcLbGUWVG5yFfvxEAlf/b3b3gbWmE00BKrMGDV9KVMDohm\nF+DypyX3vTOu+o78lZnZHv3kcnlHj4JFng7n9m6P1W2QYBBlI09brXPFxbqupYxF\nWZn27js7wgLng51kEt8OrpiWyZ1IHM2VtAwwMJR8Ga7EXZPHKgW9nH/gYGf550O8\niu3GL79/RGWc3Xf6gjjOUxc1bC4+2h2f6h6m++gxqmgAd35qFQ8tO9qeAhQyi7Rd\nJKh4RbV1l03vKW6YblZJBtPLRrZ+3J4olMoAAnl3FNbP1J2tH8JFeLIi+w38sooo\nHJ9vHUr8Fg4PaOsbGa2yGfsRZEf5IcfuF0DR4ydTzODF2K3XWN1GZdA6XdCawXeW\nM7lOC13s2ufBxVvNJf0LGeygl7QdJ0O+MYAmlENmCSEegfNRPog2MlLMCFAIVq82\nqvN1nCLwLBv12LVbm8rjlAWFUgPNUW4fVoC/n4HUzvfqcObEKo49nKyKRnQoJtr5\nAACyKEYQ6iETgysJr9FcHkRQGyvTKS4l8/yq6lBj3qbosSJlhJwUTQbFIDi1CUDa\nXaoZbVfGD06N2548j9/aSo5MfDa7oyPmDIJZiu0RqOWh0oysSfgdciXHzlIorIyj\nXbCv2uzfeBLIEoRwOqS3\n=qFlz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T06:29:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user