low/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/da2d8e5f371cecba825097b83f0408a3cc923414","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKGRhMmQ4ZTVmMzcxY2VjYmE4MjUwOTdiODNmMDQwOGEzY2M5MjM0MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0","sha":"08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f","sha":"39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f"}],"sha":"da2d8e5f371cecba825097b83f0408a3cc923414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/da2d8e5f371cecba825097b83f0408a3cc923414"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:09:16Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:09:16Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Give the debounce tests a margin that survives a loaded runner\n\n`Write debounced values into DB` and its Raw sibling failed sporadically, most\nrecently on adapter-tests-sqlite (22.x, windows-latest) while the five other\nSQLite combinations passed; a re-run of the identical commit was green. The\nsame pair is called out as timing-sensitive in #554.\n\nThe cause is a relationship that was nowhere expressed. The datapoints in\npreInit() use `debounceTime: 500`, and logSampleData() spaced the values that\nare supposed to be kept 600 ms apart - a 100 ms margin between two processes.\nWhen a state change reaches the adapter late, its debounce timer starts late,\nthe next value arrives before it fires and restarts it, and a value the test\nexpects is swallowed.\n\nThat is exactly the reported assertion. The check walks the sequence\n[1, 2.5, 3, 4, 5, 5, 6, 7, 7] and requires every returned value to be <= the\ncurrent milestone; `4 <= expectedVals[expectedId]` fails when an earlier\nmilestone is missing, so the pointer is still at 2.5 or 3 when the 4 arrives.\n\nThe two debounce callers now pass the existing waitMultiplier as 2.5, putting\nthe kept gaps at 1500 ms against the 500 ms window while the bursts stay at\n50 ms, far inside it. logSampleData() documents what the gaps have to satisfy,\nso the next person changing either number can see the constraint.\n\n`testValueBlocked` deliberately keeps 1.5: its gaps have to stay *below* its\nblockTime of 1500 ms, so raising them globally would have made that test assert\nsomething else. Only the two debounce callers are changed.\n\nThe sequence now takes ~36 s, so the two tests get 90 s instead of 45 s - the\nsecond failure mode in the same CI job was a bare \"Timeout of 45000ms\nexceeded\". The blocked test is unchanged at ~30 s against its 45 s.\n\nNot verified locally: the integration suite refuses to start while something\nlistens on port 9000, and this machine has a live ioBroker admin there. CI\nexercises the suite on six SQLite combinations plus the other three dialects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5157c5ea47408b0b7dd8ac2e6cc2a78f6a1b25d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/5157c5ea47408b0b7dd8ac2e6cc2a78f6a1b25d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKDM5ZjMzZmI4MTZhMGQyYWUzMTZjZTk3NjBhYzZlMzA0ODgwMjU0OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0","sha":"08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0"}],"sha":"39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/39f33fb816a0d2ae316ce9760ac6e3048802549f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/08c33c087256521569a6de998351ccd5a49a34d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:53:53Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"Bluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:53:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #571 from ioBroker/fix/statistics-translations\n\nTranslate the statistics component and