ithub.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commits/e159bffa26e92eb0e03b027d4161b3b66e738c89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:28:00Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:28:00Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Translate the statistics component and the recent config strings\n\nThe statistics tab rendered raw keys - `sql_col_id`, `sql_cleanup`,\n`sql_summary_total` - in every language but English, because #569 added the\n24 component strings to en.json only. Nothing falls back to English here: a\nmissing key is shown verbatim, which is why `sql_filter` rendered correctly\n(it already existed in every language) while the new ones did not.\n\nAll nine other languages now carry the 24 keys, with the `%s` placeholders\nchecked to appear the same number of times as in English.\n\nThe same gap existed in admin/i18n for 18 keys added by #565 and #566 - the\nunix socket strings, the Docker panel labels and `Statistics`. Those were less\nvisible because for jsonConfig the key *is* the English text, so they rendered\nas English rather than as nonsense. `docker_explanation` was the exception and\nshowed its raw key.\n\nadmin/custom/i18n holds the copies the admin actually loads for the component,\nso they are updated too.\n\nCLAUDE.md says the non-English files belong to Weblate and should not be hand\nedited. That rule is there so hand edits do not fight the translation round\ntrip - but shipping raw keys to every non-English user is worse than a\ntranslation Weblate may later refine, and these files are additions rather than\nedits of existing entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab109e240c420987bdba7f9d97af5c2f14ee5f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/ab109e240c420987bdba7f9d97af5c2f14ee5f7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/e159bffa26e92eb0e03b027d4161b3b66e738c89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/e159bffa26e92eb0e03b027d4161b3b66e738c89","node_id":"C_kwDOAsJ71NoAKGUxNTliZmZhMjZlOTJlYjBlMDNiMDI3ZDQxNjFiM2I2NmU3MzhjODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/7317faa93de359ee3119c16ed0f9bb69384f9ff2","sha":"7317faa93de359ee3119c16ed0f9bb69384f9ff2","url":"https://api.github.c