61a00d45d5e0b11daf1fc13241628e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:42:05Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:42:05Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Fix the two eslint findings in the statistics component\n\n`npm run lint` was not run before pushing - only prettier and the type checks -\nso check-and-lint caught both, and every adapter-tests job was skipped because\nit needs that one.\n\n- `sortField: ''count'' as SortField` tripped no-unnecessary-type-assertion. The\n  literal is already assignable; the assertion only hid that.\n- `super.componentDidMount()` was left floating. DataBrowser awaits it, which is\n  what this should have done from the start.\n\nBundle rebuilt so the committed output matches the source.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe1f9acf09b2ff9edb3cf1f5f51d5c93c78fb7ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/fe1f9acf09b2ff9edb3cf1f5f51d5c93c78fb7ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/d654453561a00d45d5e0b11daf1fc13241628e3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gith