anBluefox"},"message":"CLAUDE.md: correct the admin translation paths\n\nThe translations are flat files, `admin/i18n/<lang>.json`, not\n`admin/i18n/<lang>/translations.json` - looking for the documented path finds\nnothing. `admin/words.js`, described as \"legacy and unused\", no longer exists\nat all, so the sentence pointed at a file that is not there either. The data\nbrowser''s own translations under `admin/custom/i18n/` were not mentioned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b2a1fa03d21a6c8f972b3e9bd6fce8752bca790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/trees/0b2a1fa03d21a6c8f972b3e9bd6fce8752bca790"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/git/commits/84346d6b2a4c66ff9d4737b0ab69d434d42cb8c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.sql/commit/84346d6b2a4c66ff9d4737b0ab69d